{"parentUuid":"0f3ac3ad-6a08-44a8-8592-a0bf3a0adc0c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"85816d1e-0dae-4525-8901-7c6fa40743be","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015yRHdEYHBVAe3RnCQuNWUq","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[computer:wait] Waited for 2 seconds"},{"type":"text","text":"[get_page_text] Title: Credits and plans · JusPrin\nURL: https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/web/prices\nSource element: <main>\n---\nLAUNCH CELEBRATION\nDouble credits on everything\n\nEvery credit pack, and every month of every plan, until 31 Jan.\n\nYou’re on Hobby: 1,500 of 1,500 credits left, ending 10 Dec.\n\nBilling\n\nA Standard message is 1 credit and an Expert message is 5. Only messages you send cost credits.\n\nCredit pack\n2× launch bonus\n$10\nonce\n\n500 1,000 credits.\n\nThese credits never expire.\n\nBuy a credit pack\nHobby\n2× launch bonus\n$10\na month\n\n750 1,500 credits a month.\n\nThese credits reset each month. Unused ones don’t carry over.\n\nYour plan\nWorkshop\n2× launch bonus\n$20\na month\n\n1,000 2,000 credits a month. Standard messages cost 0 credits.\n\nThese credits reset each month. Unused ones don’t carry over.\n\nSubscribe to Workshop\n\nAfter your first month, accounts without a plan get 50 free credits a month. Your own API key stays free and never uses credits."},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: 268836818\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId 268836817: \"JusPrin\" (\"https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/web/done\")\n  • tabId 268836818: \"Credits and plans · JusPrin\" (\"https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/web/prices\")\n  • tabId 268836821: \"Log in to your PayPal account\" (\"https://www.paypal.com/signin?returnUri=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.paypal.com%2Fbusinessmanage%2Faccount%2FaboutBusiness\")\n  • tabId 268836847: \"Transactions – TSD Technology, LLC – Stripe\" (\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1CrFhqLPS4omY4v8/payments/REDACTED\")"}]}]},"uuid":"da952e42-74e8-43a5-9f73-49044707ae64","timestamp":"2026-11-10T21:09:13.790Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"[computer:wait] Waited for 2 seconds"},{"type":"text","text":"[get_page_text] Title: Credits and plans · JusPrin\nURL: https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/web/prices\nSource element: <main>\n---\nLAUNCH CELEBRATION\nDouble credits on everything\n\nEvery credit pack, and every month of every plan, until 31 Jan.\n\nYou’re on Hobby: 1,500 of 1,500 credits left, ending 10 Dec.\n\nBilling\n\nA Standard message is 1 credit and an Expert message is 5. Only messages you send cost credits.\n\nCredit pack\n2× launch bonus\n$10\nonce\n\n500 1,000 credits.\n\nThese credits never expire.\n\nBuy a credit pack\nHobby\n2× launch bonus\n$10\na month\n\n750 1,500 credits a month.\n\nThese credits reset each month. Unused ones don’t carry over.\n\nYour plan\nWorkshop\n2× launch bonus\n$20\na month\n\n1,000 2,000 credits a month. Standard messages cost 0 credits.\n\nThese credits reset each month. Unused ones don’t carry over.\n\nSubscribe to Workshop\n\nAfter your first month, accounts without a plan get 50 free credits a month. Your own API key stays free and never uses credits."},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: 268836818\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId 268836817: \"JusPrin\" (\"https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/web/done\")\n  • tabId 268836818: \"Credits and plans · JusPrin\" (\"https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/web/prices\")\n  • tabId 268836821: \"Log in to your PayPal account\" (\"https://www.paypal.com/signin?returnUri=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.paypal.com%2Fbusinessmanage%2Faccount%2FaboutBusiness\")\n  • tabId 268836847: \"Transactions – TSD Technology, LLC – Stripe\" (\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1CrFhqLPS4omY4v8/payments/REDACTED\")"}],"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0f3ac3ad-6a08-44a8-8592-a0bf3a0adc0c","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external