{"parentUuid":"b9238687-ec8c-44ee-b21a-420f420733ed","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cguw4SAzmhZFEFahJrhMp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The staging purchase went through without the billing form, granting user 500 both the 500-credit pack and the 500 launch bonus from invoice 16. I'm recording these settings in the server setup doc so the live JusPrin site is configured the same way.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":397,"cache_read_input_tokens":204031,"output_tokens":1101,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":307},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":397,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1101,"cache_read_input_tokens":204031,"cache_creation_input_tokens":397,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":397},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":1,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cguw4Rst1nAmhG4Wa461h","requestRef":"2a6551e5-f77a-4c92-8d21-89f041571b47","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a7b5d9b9-73ea-4986-9705-f2d4d8b16701","timestamp":"2026-11-10T21:09:46.548Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/resources/jusprin/overlay/images","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
{"parentUuid":"a7b5d9b9-73ea-4986-9705-f2d4d8b16701","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cguw4SAzmhZFEFahJrhMp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013h5nAvxg5fa924HfVke3HA","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise-worktrees/jusprin-v2-own-chargebee/docs/jusprin2-host-setup.md","old_string":"- Self-Serve Portal: set \"Customers can access the self-serve portal\" to\n  \"Via Single Sign On API\". Otherwise Chargebee refuses the server's portal\n  link with \"Customer portal access via API is disabled\".\n","new_string":"- Self-Serve Portal: set \"Customers can access the self-serve portal\" to\n  \"Via Single Sign On API\". Otherwise Chargebee refuses the server's portal\n  link with \"Customer portal access via API is disabled\".\n\nUnder Fields on the same page, disable the Billing and Shipping sections, and\nunder Payments turn on the card's Address Fields with only Zip and Country.\nNo tax is set up, so nothing needs a billing address; Obico's site asks the\nsame. Turn billing back on, with at least the country, if the site ever\ncollects tax.\n\nUnder Settings › Configure Chargebee › Brand Styles, upload JusPrin's logo\n(the app's `resources/jusprin/overlay/images/OrcaSlicer_horizontal_light.svg`\nas a PNG), the mark as the icon, and `jusprin/static/jusprinv2/img/favicon.png`\nas the favicon, and set the brand color to `#3A2D64`. Under Checkout\n(Customize Checkout), set the accent color to `#3A2D64` and the header and\npage colors to `#F6F2F7`, JusPrin's page background. Without a logo the\ncheckout shows an empty band above \"Back to cart\".\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":397,"cache_read_input_tokens":204031,"output_tokens":1101,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":307},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":397,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1101,"cache_read_input_tokens":204031,"cache_creation_input_tokens":397,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":397},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_013h5nAvxg5fa924HfVke3HA":{"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise-worktrees/jusprin-v2-own-chargebee/docs/jusprin2-host-setup.md","old_string":"- Self-Serve Portal: set \"Customers can access the self-serve portal\" to\n  \"Via Single Sign On API\". Otherwise Chargebee refuses the server's portal\n  link with \"Customer portal access via API is disabled\".\n","new_string":"- Self-Serve Portal: set \"Customers can access the self-serve portal\" to\n  \"Via Single Sign On API\". Otherwise Chargebee refuses the server's portal\n  link with \"Customer portal access via API is disabled\".\n\nUnder Fields on the same page, disable the Billing and Shipping sections, and\nunder Payments turn on the card's Address Fields with only Zip and Country.\nNo tax is set up, so nothing needs a billing address; Obico's site asks the\nsame. Turn billing back on, with at least the country, if the site ever\ncollects tax.\n\nUnder Settings › Configure Chargebee › Brand Styles, upload JusPrin's logo\n(the app's `resources/jusprin/overlay/images/OrcaSlicer_horizontal_light.svg`\nas a PNG), the mark as the icon, and `jusprin/static/jusprinv2/img/favicon.png`\nas the favicon, and set the brand color to `#3A2D64`. Under Checkout\n(Customize Checkout), set the accent color to `#3A2D64` and the header and\npage colors to `#F6F2F7`, JusPrin's page background. Without a logo the\ncheckout shows an empty band above \"Back to cart\".\n"}},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cguw4Rst1nAmhG4Wa461h","requestRef":"2a6551e5-f77a-4c92-8d21-89f041571b47","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7fc13d90-b1b4-4846-977d-69aed7af02fa","timestamp":"2026-11-10T21:09:50.829Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/resources/jusprin/overlay/images","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
{"parentUuid":"7fc13d90-b1b4-4846-977d-69aed7af02fa","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"85816d1e-0dae-4525-8901-7c6fa40743be","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013h5nAvxg5fa924HfVke3HA","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise-worktrees/jusprin-v2-own-chargebee/docs/jusprin2-host-setup.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"b4e506dd-0b17-461b-9fb0-ce45d768af95","timestamp":"2026-11-10T21:09:50.877Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise-worktrees/jusprin-v2-own-chargebee/docs/jusprin2-host-setup.md","oldString":"- Self-Serve Portal: set \"Customers can access the self-serve portal\" to\n  \"Via Single Sign On API\". Otherwise Chargebee refuses the server's portal\n  link with \"Customer portal access via API is disabled\".\n","newString":"- Self-Serve Portal: set \"Customers can access the self-serve portal\" to\n  \"Via Single Sign On API\". Otherwise Chargebee refuses the server's portal\n  link with \"Customer portal access via API is disabled\".\n\nUnder Fields on the same page, disable the Billing and Shipping sections, and\nunder Payments turn on the card's Address Fields with only Zip and Country.\nNo tax is set up, so nothing needs a billing address; Obico's site asks the\nsame. Turn billing back on, with at least the country, if the site ever\ncollects tax.\n\nUnder Settings › Configure Chargebee › Brand Styles, upload JusPrin's logo\n(the app's `resources/jusprin/overlay/images/OrcaSlicer_horizontal_light.svg`\nas a PNG), the mark as the icon, and `jusprin/static/jusprinv2/img/favicon.png`\nas the favicon, and set the brand color to `#3A2D64`. Under Checkout\n(Customize Checkout), set the accent color to `#3A2D64` and the header and\npage colors to `#F6F2F7`, JusPrin's page background. Without a logo the\ncheckout shows an empty band above \"Back to cart\".\n","originalFile":"# Setting up JusPrin 2's host on a server\n\nJusPrin 2 signs in on a host of its own, such as `jusprinv2-stg.obico.io` on\nstaging. Accounts made through that host belong to the `jusprinv2` syndicate,\napart from any Obico account with the same email: the request's host picks the\nsyndicate (`obico-server/backend/lib/syndicate.py`). Google sign-in on that host\nuses JusPrin's own Google client, so Google's sign-in screens are JusPrin's,\nnot Obico's. Each server needs this set up once, by hand.\n`web_ent/jusprin/v2/tests/jusprin_host.py` builds the same rows for the tests.\n\nStaging was set up on 2026-11-10. Production has no JusPrin 2 host yet; its\nhost will be `jusprinv2.obico.io`, which the Google client already accepts as\na redirect address. Neither server has JusPrin 2's own Chargebee site\n(section 3) yet.\n\n## 1. The syndicate and the site\n\nThe Django admin doesn't edit syndicates, so run this in a Django shell on the\nweb pod (`python manage.py shell`), with the host's name:\n\n```python\nfrom django.contrib.sites.models import Site\nfrom app.models import SiteSyndicate, Syndicate\n\ndomain = 'jusprinv2.obico.io'\nsyndicate, _ = Syndicate.objects.get_or_create(name='jusprinv2')\nsite, _ = Site.objects.get_or_create(domain=domain, defaults={'name': 'JusPrin'})\nSiteSyndicate.objects.update_or_create(site=site, defaults={'syndicate': syndicate})\n```\n\nIt changes nothing when run again.\n\n## 2. Google sign-in\n\nThe Google client is \"JusPrin 2 server\", a Web application client in the\nGoogle Cloud project `jusprin`:\n\n- Client ID: `477983024689-h769gibj38tbs3smov9mci575t0khkbf.apps.googleusercontent.com`\n- Redirect addresses: `https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/accounts/google/login/callback/`\n  and `https://jusprinv2.obico.io/accounts/google/login/callback/`\n\nIn the admin, under Social applications, add one:\n\n- Provider: Google\n- Name: `JusPrin Google`\n- Client id: the client ID above\n- Secret key: the client's secret. Google shows a secret only when it is made,\n  so take it from wherever it was stored then, or add a new secret on the\n  client's page in the Google Cloud console.\n- Sites: only JusPrin 2's host.\n\nallauth refuses a site that two Google apps serve, so if another Google app\n(Obico's) has JusPrin 2's host ticked, untick it there.\n\n## 3. Chargebee\n\nJusPrin 2 sells credit packs and plans on a Chargebee site of its own,\n`jusprinv2`, not on Obico's. Its test site is `jusprinv2-test`, which local\nservers and staging use. Both sites use Chargebee's Product Catalog 2.0\n(`web_ent/jusprin/ledger/billing.py` says what that changes).\n\nSet these on the web pods:\n\n- `JUSPRIN_V2_CHARGEBEE_SITE`: `jusprinv2-test` on staging, `jusprinv2` on\n  production.\n- `JUSPRIN_V2_CHARGEBEE_API_KEY`: a full-access API key of that site.\n- `JUSPRIN_V2_CHARGEBEE_CUSTOMER_PREFIX`: `jusprinv2-stg-` on staging; leave\n  it unset elsewhere (`jusprinv2-`). An account's Chargebee customer is this\n  prefix and its user id. Staging and local servers share the test site, and\n  user ids repeat across servers, so without its own prefix staging would take\n  a local server's customers and events as its own.\n\nThe site's product catalog needs these ids, which the server names in\n`settings_ent.py`:\n\n- Plan item prices `jusprin-hobby-monthly` ($10 a month) and\n  `jusprin-workshop-monthly` ($20 a month).\n- Charge item price `jusprin-credit-pack-USD` ($10), the credit pack.\n- Coupon `jusprin2-obico-premium-20`, 20% off forever, for the two plans only.\n\nUnder Settings › Configure Chargebee › Checkout & Self-Serve Portal ›\nConfiguration:\n\n- Checkout: turn off \"Allow customers to edit quantity for plans\", and turn on\n  \"Allow customers to add/remove coupons\".\n- Checkout: One time payments: leave it enabled; the credit pack is bought\n  through it.\n- Self-Serve Portal: set \"Customers can access the self-serve portal\" to\n  \"Via Single Sign On API\". Otherwise Chargebee refuses the server's portal\n  link with \"Customer portal access via API is disabled\".\n\nUnder Settings › Configure Chargebee › Webhooks, add\n`https://<server>/ent/jusprin/v2/cb_webhook`, where `<server>` is the server's\nown host (`app-stg.obico.io` on staging). The server trusts a post only for\nthe event's id and reads the event back from the site with its key, so the\nwebhook needs no password.\n\n## 4. Check it\n\nOpen `https://<host>/accounts/google/login/?process=login`. It should redirect\nto `accounts.google.com` with the client ID above and\n`redirect_uri=https://<host>/accounts/google/login/callback/`.\n\nSigned in on the host, open `https://<host>/ent/jusprin/v2/web/prices` and\nstart a credit-pack checkout. It should open a `jusprinv2` (or\n`jusprinv2-test`) checkout page for $10. On the test site, pay with\nChargebee's test card 4111 1111 1111 1111; the account should gain 500\ncredits, plus the launch bonus while that offer runs.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":89,"oldLines":6,"newStart":89,"newLines":20,"lines":["   \"Via Single Sign On API\". Otherwise Chargebee refuses the server's portal","   link with \"Customer portal access via API is disabled\"."," ","+Under Fields on the same page, disable the Billing and Shipping sections, and","+under Payments turn on the card's Address Fields with only Zip and Country.","+No tax is set up, so nothing needs a billing address; Obico's site asks the","+same. Turn billing back on, with at least the country, if the site ever","+collects tax.","+","+Under Settings › Configure Chargebee › Brand Styles, upload JusPrin's logo","+(the app's `resources/jusprin/overlay/images/OrcaSlicer_horizontal_light.svg`","+as a PNG), the mark as the icon, and `jusprin/static/jusprinv2/img/favicon.png`","+as the favicon, and set the brand color to `#3A2D64`. Under Checkout","+(Customize Checkout), set the accent color to `#3A2D64` and the header and","+page colors to `#F6F2F7`, JusPrin's page background. Without a logo the","+checkout shows an empty band above \"Back to cart\".","+"," Under Settings › Configure Chargebee › Webhooks, add"," `https://<server>/ent/jusprin/v2/cb_webhook`, where `<server>` is the server's"," own host (`app-stg.obico.io` on staging). The server trusts a post only for"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7fc13d90-b1b4-4846-977d-69aed7af02fa","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/resources/jusprin/overlay/images","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
