{"parentUuid":"8a5ef361-c141-4472-9eaf-ed0d220e5076","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Plain"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"5d7a3b31-e9f1-4e01-af90-83d46080c95c","timestamp":"2026-11-10T21:09:53.622Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nPlain output style is active. Remember to follow the specific guidelines for this style.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise-worktrees/jusprin-v2-own-chargebee","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","hash":"317101957a15548375838a3edfc70126ce218b713b124934a345939304264e1a","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The staging purchase went through without the billing form, granting user 500 both the 500-credit pack and the 500 launch bonus from invoice 16. I'm recording these settings in the server setup doc so the live JusPrin site is configured the same way.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013h5nAvxg5fa924HfVke3HA","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise-worktrees/jusprin-v2-own-chargebee/docs/jusprin2-host-setup.md","old_string":"- Self-Serve Portal: set \"Customers can access the self-serve portal\" to\n  \"Via Single Sign On API\". Otherwise Chargebee refuses the server's portal\n  link with \"Customer portal access via API is disabled\".\n","new_string":"- Self-Serve Portal: set \"Customers can access the self-serve portal\" to\n  \"Via Single Sign On API\". Otherwise Chargebee refuses the server's portal\n  link with \"Customer portal access via API is disabled\".\n\nUnder Fields on the same page, disable the Billing and Shipping sections, and\nunder Payments turn on the card's Address Fields with only Zip and Country.\nNo tax is set up, so nothing needs a billing address; Obico's site asks the\nsame. Turn billing back on, with at least the country, if the site ever\ncollects tax.\n\nUnder Settings › Configure Chargebee › Brand Styles, upload JusPrin's logo\n(the app's `resources/jusprin/overlay/images/OrcaSlicer_horizontal_light.svg`\nas a PNG), the mark as the icon, and `jusprin/static/jusprinv2/img/favicon.png`\nas the favicon, and set the brand color to `#3A2D64`. Under Checkout\n(Customize Checkout), set the accent color to `#3A2D64` and the header and\npage colors to `#F6F2F7`, JusPrin's page background. Without a logo the\ncheckout shows an empty band above \"Back to cart\".\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VBH2AAJTNHT4Tu5nYBrhXw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise-worktrees/jusprin-v2-own-chargebee && git status --short && git branch --show-current && git fetch -q origin && git log --oneline -1 origin/master && git log --oneline origin/master..HEAD | head","description":"Check the worktree state before committing"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
