{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","hash":"d25f4e28ed8c2adf2da84116077820a4889e0f7658d8443d516bd94e85abe6d4","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The JusPrin 2 test catalog holds the hobby and workshop monthly plans, the credit-pack addon and the premium coupon, while the JusPrin 1 unlimited plans stay as they are. Next I'm looking for the JusPrin 2 test customers and the template and custom-field changes made there earlier.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EdP4NWffGATW6v7SBDX6uF","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"S=/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79/scratchpad; source $S/obico-test.env; B=https://thespaghettidetective-test.chargebee.com/api/v2\necho \"== customers jusprinv2*\"; curl -s -u REDACTED -G \"$B/customers\" --data-urlencode \"id[starts_with]=jusprinv2\" -d limit=100 | python3 -c \"\nimport sys,json\nd=json.load(sys.stdin)\nfor x in d['list']: c=x['customer']; print(c['id'],'|',c.get('email'),'|',c.get('created_at'),'|',c.get('cf_syndicate', ''), {k:v for k,v in c.items() if k.startswith('cf_')})\nprint('n=',len(d['list']),'next',d.get('next_offset'))\"\nfor f in plan_id addon_id; do :; done\necho \"== subscriptions on JusPrin 2 plans\"; for p in jusprin-hobby-monthly jusprin-workshop-monthly; do curl -s -u REDACTED -G \"$B/subscriptions\" --data-urlencode \"plan_id[is]=$p\" -d limit=100 | python3 -c \"\nimport sys,json\nd=json.load(sys.stdin)\nfor x in d['list']: s=x['subscription']; print('$p',s['id'],s['customer_id'],s['status'])\nprint('$p n=',len(d['list']))\"; done","description":"List JusPrin 2 test customers and subscriptions on Obico's test site"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MACFhvcPnoWbGU6pH1CpM7","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/kenneth/Library/Application Support/Claude/side-session-notes/local_3e38de32-e8df-4f8c-b26d-1a20db4c0aca\"; ls -la \"$N\"; grep -n -i 'test site\\|thespaghettidetective-test\\|custom field\\|cf_\\|template\\|notification' \"$N/chargebee-jusprin-emails-draft.md\" | head -60","description":"Read the shared notes for what was changed on Obico's test site"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
