{"parentUuid":"87a129ca-fcfc-494b-81c3-7a60aa12dc7b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d3cef047-f25f-4980-9952-f7c49a687725","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013oxehoZYxxkgFda3ZT7FRE","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[navigate] Navigated to https://thespaghettidetective-test.chargebee.com/apikeys_and_webhooks/webhooks"},{"type":"text","text":"[computer:wait] Waited for 3 seconds"},{"type":"text","text":"[get_page_text] Title: API Keys and Events - Chargebee\nURL: https://thespaghettidetective-test.chargebee.com/apikeys_and_webhooks/webhooks\nSource element: <body>\n---\nBilling\nthespaghettidetective\nTest\nthespaghettidetective-test.chargebee.com\nGo to\n⌘\nK\nHome\nCustomers\nSubscriptions\nInvoices & Credit Notes\nProduct Catalog\nUsages\nNEW\nEntitlements\nLogs\nReceivables\nNEW\nRevenueStory\nClassic Reports\nApps\nSettings\nConfigure Chargebee\nImport & Export Data\nTeam Members\nChargebee Notifications\nSecurity\nSet up Chargebee\nYour pricing, set up in minutes\nWhat's new\nNeed Help?\nKE\nKenneth\nk@thespaghettidetective.com\nTest site — Safe to simulate and experiment\nConfigure Chargebee\nAPI Keys and Events\nAPI Keys (2)\nWebhooks (2)\nEvent Streams (0)\nNote : In sandbox sites, webhook delivery may be delayed by up to 10–15 minutes, depending on system load. This delay does not occur in the Live environment.\nWebhooks notify your application about events that occur in Chargebee asynchronously through HTTP POST request. You can set up a maximum of 5 webhooks on this Chargebee Site. Learn more\nAdd Webhook\nngrok\nID\nwhv2_169yBJRwjzUAx1RYq\n\nhttps://d5c2-75-103-5-166.ngrok-free.app/ent/cb_webhook/\n\nDeactivated\n\nstg\nID\nwhv2_16BU1CUpxGr6p4xrH\n\nhttps://app-stg.obico.io/ent/cb_webhook/\n\nTest Webhook\n\n⚡\nTest webhooks instantly\nSend Chargebee event payloads to a local or remote server. Events are forwarded through a lightweight proxy — no CORS issues, no delays.\nOpen API Explorer\nPriva