{"parentUuid":"1b951fdc-cf81-483e-802c-2f977ed4f057","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CguwhG4Zi7QG6bTQ2y6ve","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Obico's Chargebee test site (thespaghettidetective-test) is cleaned up: everything JusPrin 2 left there is deleted. Obico's own plans and addons, and JusPrin 1's plans, are still there. I didn't touch Obico's live site.\n\n**Deleted**\n- **Plans:** `jusprin-hobby-monthly` and `jusprin-workshop-monthly`.\n- **Addon:** `jusprin-credit-pack`.\n- **Coupon:** `jusprin2-obico-premium-20` (20% off for Obico Premium users).\n- **Test customers:** `jusprinv2-57`, `jusprinv2-59`, `jusprinv2-490`, `jusprinv2-491` and `jusprinv2-492`. Their one Hobby subscription and their invoices went with them. Chargebee now answers \"not found\" for them.\n\n**Kept on purpose**\n- **JusPrin 1's plans:** `jusprin-unlimited-monthly` and `jusprin-unlimited-annual`, since JusPrin 1 still sells on Obico's sites.\n- **Obico's own items:** all 8 Obico plans and all 15 Obico addons, every one still `active`.\n- **Webhooks:** the site's two webhooks both belong to Obico, and neither points at the JusPrin 2 server.\n\n**Checked before deleting**\n- Obico's webhook handler reacts only to subscription changes and new invoices. The deletions sent nothing to staging that it acts on.\n- The email-template experiments and the `cf_product` custom field were already removed in an earlier cleanup on 10 Nov.\n\n**One leftover, on staging rather than Chargebee:** staging test user 491 (a JusPrin 2 test account created on 9 Nov) still has a Hobby plan record that points at the subscription I just deleted. The record ends on 10 Dec. Until then, opening that account's plan management on staging would fail, because the server would look for that subscription on JusPrin's new Chargebee site. No real user is affected."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":383,"cache_read_input_tokens":233715,"output_tokens":676,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":383,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":676,"cache_read_input_tokens":233715,"cache_creation_input_tokens":383,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":383},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CguwhFeW6mxQZ3deuDaGL","requestRef":"976b045e-0596-48e5-9b47-675268d828f2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"08998af3-904e-41bb-86b2-3409f704ffc4","timestamp":"2026-11-10T21:18:07.359Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise-worktrees/jusprin-v2-own-chargebee","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
