 UTC — rollout finished, smoke test waiting on Kenneth\n- All four prod deployments (web, ws, tasks, rttasks) on obi.4098; tsdbeat-prod unchanged on obi.4036.\n- Mixed-version window on prod: 03:43:14–03:46:11 UTC (Sentry issues 2038 and 2039, 294 events in all, \"relation app_syndicate_sites does not exist\"). Nothing since then. The probe of app.obico.io and app.thespaghettidetective.com returned 656/656 200 since 03:47.\n- Sentry 2040: one scanner hit jusprinv2.obico.io/accounts/login/ at 03:46:15, before the Site row existed. Not a regression.\n- ManagedCertificate gke-managed-cert-jusprinv2-app is Active.\n- jusprinv2.obico.io answers like jusprinv2-stg: login and signup 404, password reset 200, /hc/ 200.\n- tsdws-prod scale-down per prod/release.sh: 12→11 at ~04:16 UTC, 11→10 at ~04:21 (scratchpad/scaledown.sh, pid 63215).\n- migrate-runner-prod pod kept until the smoke test passes.\n- The smoke test needs Kenneth: this Mac caches a \"not found\" DNS answer for jusprinv2.obico.io for ~75 min unless flushed with sudo. He also has to do the two production sign-ups.\n\n## 2026-11-10 ~04:55 UTC — smoke test passed, ops committed (not pushed)\n- Kenneth signed up on production from the test app: user 263740 k+jusprinv2-smoke@obico.io (emailed code) and 263741 k@obico.io (Google). Each got a 500-credit signup grant expiring 2026-12-10.\n- Gateway on production, called with the app's saved key: Standard (responses format, OpenRouter DeepSeek) and Expert (anthropic format, Claude) both answered; charged 1 and 5 credits, 494 left on 263741.\n- Credits and plans and Billing and usage pages open signed in through /ent/jusprin/v2/web_link and show the right balance and usage rows. No checkout attempted.\n- No Sentry issues in obico-server or obico-frontend since 03:47. tsdws-prod scaled 12→10. migrate-runner-prod deleted.\n- ~/Projects/ops commit d9d4cc1; master is 52 commits ahead of origin, push waits on Kenneth.\n\n## 2026-11-10 ~05:00 UTC — chats in the real app\n- op