rivacy policy promises opt-in for AI training). JUSPRIN_V2_CAPTURE_CONTAINER stays blank in prod. Opt-in work proposed as task_6ad51eec.\n- Buckets stg-jusprin-v2 / prod-jusprin-v2 exist; appserviceaccount-storage-lp has no permission on either; tsdbeat-prod (obi.4036) lacks flush_jusprin_chats.\n- Chargebee live email branding handed to local_1ae65d86 with Kenneth's words.\n\n## 2026-11-10 — cleanup\n- Test app copy stopped; its data folder (with k@obico.io's production key) deleted. tsd-enterprise worktree release-jusprinv2-prod removed (was clean, at origin/release 1cbd23803e). Sentry 2038, 2039, 2040 resolved (none since 03:46 UTC).\n- Still mine: test accounts (prod 263740 smoke; staging k+rollout-stg-obico-1109, k+rollout-stg-kingroon-1109) awaiting Kenneth's word on deletion; Premium discount matches unverified Obico addresses (not handed to anyone).\n\n- Test accounts deleted with Kenneth's yes: prod 263740, staging 495 and 496 (through jusprin.v2.views._delete_account). Production 263741 (k@obico.io) kept.\n(eval):1: ===== not found","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ELHjVcBrm9vZ6f2FVetxcR"}]}}
