{"parentUuid":"42d79c1b-bd1c-4a1a-a253-4c2c8f505d23","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CguxSAtTTKUWpRXuH8ynn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VegzRUTtGttnTLzahm1yJF","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"N=\"/Users/kenneth/Library/Application Support/Claude/side-session-notes/local_3e38de32-e8df-4f8c-b26d-1a20db4c0aca\"; cat >> \"$N/chargebee-jusprin-emails-draft.md\" <<'EOF'\n\n## Production readiness check (2026-11-10, late)\n- Obico's test site cleaned (Kenneth asked): deleted plans jusprin-hobby-monthly, jusprin-workshop-monthly, addon jusprin-credit-pack, coupon jusprin2-obico-premium-20, customers jusprinv2-57/59/490/491/492. Obico plans/addons and JusPrin 1 jusprin-unlimited-* kept. Staging user 491 still has a JusPrinPlan row pointing at the deleted subscription (ends 10 Dec).\n- jusprinv2-test checkout: billing and shipping sections off, card asks optional zip + country (Kenneth said yes); logo, icon, favicon, brand color #3A2D64, accent #3A2D64, page/header #F6F2F7. Staging pack paid without billing fields: user 500 got 500+500, invoice 16. Documented in tsd-enterprise 52d1bd7974.\n- JusPrin's Chargebee account has no live site yet (site picker shows only TEST for jusprinv2).\n- Production: all five deployments obi.4098 = master 0a75568378; matches ops HEAD. Master adds f624245258, d984c46317, 77fd19cadb, 2d97f4b1c7, a72b271f7e, 52d1bd7974; no migrations. Prod has no JUSPRIN_V2_CHARGEBEE_* env. Prod jusprinv2.obico.io still on Obico's Google app (SocialApp 1); 1 jusprinv2 user.\n- ops: 1e6caf7 (staging, mine) and 3f5e1b7 (chat capture, applied to prod) not pushed.\n- App: 6f1f03867d (\"Ends <day>\") only on claude/plan-ends-line, not on jusprin-dev.\nEOF","description":"Append the readiness findings to the shared notes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input