\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/1.0/subscription-billing-guide.html\"},{\"title\":\"How can I go LIVE with Chargebee?\",\"url\":\"https://support.chargebee.com/support/solutions/articles/241127-how-can-i-go-live-with-chargebee-\"},{\"title\":\"New in Chargebee: Explore Reveal and understand your payment performance end-to-end.Try Now\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/1.0/sites-intro.html\"},{\"title\":\"New in Chargebee: Explore Reveal and understand your payment performance end-to-end.Try Now\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/2.0/sites-intro.html\"},{\"title\":\"sites intro\",\"url\":\"https://chargebee.com/docs/sites-intro.html\"},{\"title\":\"payment go live checklist\",\"url\":\"https://axonbuild.com/blog/payment-go-live-checklist/\"}]\n\nChargebee's docs describe a fairly simple activation process, followed by a checklist for the settings that don't carry over.\n\n- **Activation:** Activate your Chargebee Live site from a Test site by selecting a plan and completing checkout. The docs say to log in to your Chargebee TEST site and then review the summary and continue to activate. Only Admin or Super Admin users can do this, per these roles can select a plan and activate the Live site.\n- **Before you start:** Finish the implementation guide on the Test site first. The go-live checklist should be reviewed before you enable the Live site.\n- **After activation:** Use the checklist to transfer configurations, since you need to re-configure the following settings on the LIVE Site. Key items include:\n  - Re-inviting team members, because access is controlled at a site level, irrespective of the Test or Live site.\n  - Reconfiguring the payment gateway and tax settings on the Live site.\n  - Running test transactions: Chargebee recommends a few small-value test transactions with real cards in your Live site before offering it to your customers.\n- **Transferring settings:** Transfer Configurations is under Settings > Configure Chargebee, and you must have the Live site enabled for your Chargebee Test site to use it.\n\nThe search results didn't include a current version of the UI, so button names may differ slightly from what's described here. The official Chargebee activation and go-live checklist pages are the most reliable references.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"965d0b3a-f73c-43a5-a358-4a31f6fe56f0","timestamp":"2026-11-10T21:42:00.858Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Chargebee how to activate live site from test site \"go live\" checklist","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01RsRDDVZd65LqhxrdNfYCsW","content":[{"title":"chargebee.com","url":"https://chargebee.com/docs/checklist.html"},{"title":"New in Chargebee: Explore Reveal and understand your payment performance end-to-end.Try Now","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/1.0/checklist.html"},{"title":"New in Chargebee: Explore Reveal and understand your payment performance end-to-end.Try Now","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/2.0/checklist.html"},{"title":"New in Chargebee: Explore Reveal and understand your payment performance end-to-end.Try Now","url":"https://chargebee.com/docs/billing/1.0/implementing-chargebee/checklist"},{"title":"New in Chargebee: Explore Reveal and understand your payment performance end-to-end.Try Now","url":"https://chargebee.com/docs/billing/2.0/implementing-chargebee/checklist"},{"title":"Introducing the Chargebee CLI","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/billing/2.0/kb/getting-started/how-can-i-go-live-with-chargebee"},{"title":"how can i go live with chargebee","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/billing/1.0/kb/getting-started/how-can-i-go-live-with-chargebee"},{"title":"New in Chargebee: Explore Reveal and understand your payment performance end-to-end.Try Now","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/billing/2.0/implementing-chargebee/activate-live-site"},{"title":"implementation guide","url":"https://chargebee.com/docs/implementation_guide.html"},{"title":"how can i go live with chargebee","url":"https://chargebee.com/docs/1.0/getting-started/articles-and-faq/how-can-i-go-live-with-chargebee.html"},{"title":"Introducing the Chargebee CLI","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/1.0/subscription-billing-guide.html"},{"title":"How can I go LIVE with Chargebee?","url":"https://support.chargebee.com/support/solutions/articles/241127-how-can-i-go-live-with-chargebee-"},{"title":"New in Chargebee: Explore Reveal and understand your payment performance end-to-end.Try Now","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/1.0/sites-intro.html"},{"title":"New in Chargebee: Explore Reveal and understand your payment performance end-to-end.Try Now","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/2.0/sites-intro.html"},{"title":"sites intro","url":"https://chargebee.com/docs/sites-intro.html"},{"title":"payment go live checklist","url":"https://axonbuild.com/blog/payment-go-live-checklist/"}]},"Chargebee's docs describe a fairly simple activation process, followed by a checklist for the settings that don't carry over.\n\n- **Activation:** Activate your Chargebee Live site from a Test site by selecting a plan and completing checkout. The docs say to log in to your Chargebee TEST site and then review the summary and continue to activate. Only Admin or Super Admin users can do this, per these roles can select a plan and activate the Live site.\n- **Before you start:** Finish the implementation guide on the Test site first. The go-live checklist should be reviewed before you enable the Live site.\n- **After activation:** Use the checklist to transfer configurations, since you need to re-configure the following settings on the LIVE Site. Key items include:\n  - Re-inviting team members, because access is controlled at a site level, irrespective of the Test or Live site.\n  - Reconfiguring the payment gateway and tax settings on the Live site.\n  - Running test transactions: Chargebee recommends a few small-value test transactions with real cards in your Live site before offering it to your customers.\n- **Transferring settings:** Transfer Configurations is under Settings > Configure Chargebee, and you must have the Live site enabled for your Chargebee Test site to use it.\n\nThe search results didn't include a current version of the UI, so button names may differ slightly from what's described here. The official Chargebee activation and go-live checklist pages are the most reliable references."],"durationSeconds":4.481681625000001,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d40708d7-0b2d-424b-8cad-163dfc11493d","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
