"screenshot","tabId":268836818,"scale":0.6}}]}},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CguyYq5u6jCdmc1F8FnF6","requestRef":"d9bf78d9-a802-4dba-9563-753f90ef92dc","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"claude-in-chrome","attributionMcpTool":"browser_batch","type":"assistant","uuid":"8fb34d8c-7ac2-44e8-8940-77f14a3e326b","timestamp":"2026-11-10T21:42:25.241Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
{"parentUuid":"4232871c-fc71-40a4-ac57-f13ef39e850a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"810e949a-0f33-435b-b5d5-695268e1a569","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HFHe1sVhukmUnbmbPSJfCi","type":"tool_result","content":"## Activating your Live site\n\n**Who can do it:** Only Admin or Super Admin users can select a plan and activate the Live site.\n\n**Before you start:**\n- Finish the implementation guide on your Test site so the configuration is ready to transfer.\n- Have a card ready. Checkout collects a card on file.\n- Review Chargebee plans and pricing to understand billing.\n\n**Steps:**\n\n1. Log in to Chargebee Billing and click **Select Plan** next to your test site. You can also find it at the top-left, above the left nav bar, or on your profile page at the bottom-left.\n2. Choose a plan:\n   - **Flow** (self-serve): Select **Pay as you go** or **Commit monthly**, then click **Activate now**. The **Flow Plan: Find the right variant** calculator on the right helps you compare costs.\n   - **Enterprise Plus** (high-volume and multi-entity): Click **Talk to sales**.\n3. Choose your billing currency, then click **Activate now**. The page recommends your local currency to avoid exchange rate losses.\n4. **Contact for Technical/Billing Issues:** Enter your company name, then click **Save and Proceed**.\n5. **Billing Information:** Enter your organization name, phone number, company, and billing address. Email is optional. Keep **Ship to my billing address** on to reuse the address for shipping, or turn it off to enter a different one. Click **Save and Proceed**.\n6. **Payment Information:** Enter your card details. Keep **Use my billing address as card address** on to reuse the billing address. Click **Save and Proceed**.\n7. **Summary:** Review the details, apply a coupon if you have one, and agree to the Terms of Service, Privacy Policy, and automatic renewal. Use **Edit** to correct any section, then click **Pay & Get Started**.\n\nYour bank may show a 3D Secure (3DS) verification page before payment is confirmed.\n\n**After activation:**\n- You're redirected to your Live site. To switch between Test and Live, use the top-left corner where your site name appears.\n- Follow the Go-live Checklist to transfer configurations, reconfigure Live-site settings that don't transfer, and run test transactions. This page doesn't list which settings fall into the non-transferring group, so check the checklist for that."}]},"uuid":"53006c6a-0bac-4a77-bb05-c6a5d0bf20b8","timestamp":"2026-11-10T21:42:29.806Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":182050,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"## Activating your Live site\n\n**Who can do it:** Only Admin or Super Admin users can select a plan and activate the Live site.\n\n**Before you start:**\n- Finish the implementation guide on your Test site so the configuration is ready to transfer.\n- Have a card ready. Checkout collects a card on file.\n- Review Chargebee plans and pricing to understand billing.\n\n**Steps:**\n\n1. Log in to Chargebee Billing and click **Select Plan** next to your test site. You can also find it at the top-left, above the left nav bar, or on your profile page at the bottom-left.\n2. Choose a plan:\n   - **Flow** (self-serve): Select **Pay as you go** or **Commit monthly**, then click **Activate now**. The **Flow Plan: Find the right variant** calculator on the right helps you compare costs.\n   - **Enterprise Plus** (high-volume and multi-entity): Click **Talk to sales**.\n3. Choose your billing currency, then click **Activate now**. The page recommends your local currency to avoid exchange rate losses.\n4. **Contact for Technical/Billing Issues:** Enter your company name, then click **Save and Proceed**.\n5. **Billing Information:** Enter your organization name, phone number, company, and billing address. Email is optional. Keep **Ship to my billing address** on to reuse the address for shipping, or turn it off to enter a different one. Click **Save and Proceed**.\n6. **Payment Information:** Enter your card details. Keep **Use my billing address as card address** on to reuse the billing address. Click **Save and Proceed**.\n7. **Summary:** Review the details, apply a coupon if you have one, and agree to the Terms of Service, Privacy Policy, and automatic renewal. Use **Edit** to correct any section, then click **Pay & Get Started**.\n\nYour bank may show a 3D Secure (3DS) verification page before payment is confirmed.\n\n**After activation:**\n- You're redirected to your Live site. To switch between Test and Live, use the top-left corner where your site name appears.\n- Follow the Go-live Checklist to transfer configurations, reconfigure Live-site settings that don't transfer, and run test transactions. This page doesn't list which settings fall into the non-transferring group, so check the checklist for that.","durationMs":6021,"url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/billing/2.0/implementing-chargebee/activate-live-site"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4232871c-fc71-40a4-ac57-f13ef39e850a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
