":\"Chargebee pricing\",\"url\":\"https://www.softwares.com/software/chargebee/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Chargebee Pricing Plans & History (2026) — PricingSaaS\",\"url\":\"https://pricingsaas.com/companies/chargebee\"},{\"title\":\"All Chargebee Plans & Pricing\",\"url\":\"https://costbench.com/software/subscription-billing/chargebee/\"},{\"title\":\"www.g2.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.g2.com/products/chargebee/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"toolradar.com\",\"url\":\"https://toolradar.com/tools/chargebee/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Chargebee Pricing Calculator 2026\",\"url\":\"https://costbench.com/software/subscription-billing/chargebee/calculator/\"},{\"title\":\"chargebee vs memberful\",\"url\":\"https://getpulsesignal.com/compare/chargebee-vs-memberful\"}]\n\nChargebee's Flow plan pay-as-you-go option has no free threshold. The free allowance you're thinking of belonged to the older Starter plan.\n\n- **Flow pay-as-you-go:** Sources put it at 0.80% of monthly billing value with no platform fee and no free threshold. Flow — Pay as you go: 0.80% of monthly billing value, $0 platform fee, no free threshold.\n- **Flow commit option:** $99/mo platform fee plus 0.65% of monthly billing value. Both include 100M usage events/mo.\n- **Starter (now retired):** The free tier covered the first $250K of cumulative billing, then 0.75%. Chargebee replaced its Starter (free to $250K cumulative billing) and Performance ($7,188/yr) tiers with a single Flow plan, which is the change that ended the free entry threshold.\n- **Conflicting listings:** Some aggregators still describe a free plan. One says Chargebee has a free plan; Growth costs $99/mo. Another, checked October 11, 2026, says Chargebee has no free plan; Enterprise is quoted by sales. The later and more specific sources favor the no-free-tier reading.\n\nI did not reach Chargebee's official pricing page directly. The details above come from third-party trackers and one Chargebee retention-page snippet, so check chargebee.com/pricing before relying on the numbers.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"f336b874-3a43-48c0-a295-80e664099ee3","timestamp":"2026-11-10T21:42:45.052Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Chargebee pricing 2026 Flow plan pay as you go free up to billing amount","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01SxG2qrWrj3vbuQ4m2DizYv","content":[{"title":"chargebee 2026 08 11 flow plan consolidation","url":"https://www.usagepricing.com/blueprint/activity/chargebee-2026-08-11-flow-plan-consolidation"},{"title":"saastr ai app of the week chargebee the billing system behind how gorgias coderabbit lambda and zapier price ai","url":"https://saastr.com/saastr-ai-app-of-the-week-chargebee-the-billing-system-behind-how-gorgias-coderabbit-lambda-and-zapier-price-ai"},{"title":"chargebee 2026 08 11 packaging","url":"https://usagepricing.com/blueprint/activity/chargebee-2026-08-11-packaging"},{"title":"Table of Content","url":"https://flexprice.io/questions/chargebee-metered-usage-based-billing-explained"},{"title":"chargebee pricing","url":"https://www.swell.is/content/chargebee-pricing"},{"title":"best chargebee alternatives","url":"https://resources.rework.com/es/tools/billing-revenue/best-chargebee-alternatives"},{"title":"Table of Content","url":"https://flexprice.io/questions/chargebee-alternatives-for-ai-companies"},{"title":"Complete billing automation for (ambitiously) hybrid revenue workflows","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/retention/pricing"},{"title":"Table of Content","url":"https://flexprice.io/blog/what-is-chargebee"},{"title":"Table of Content","url":"https://flexprice.io/questions/chargebee-recurring-billing-subscription-lifecycle"},{"title":"Bahasa Indonesia","url":"https://resources.rework.com/id/tools/billing-revenue/best-chargebee-alternatives"},{"title":"chargebee pricing","url":"https://www.agencyhandy.com/chargebee-pricing"},{"title":"Chargebee pricing","url":"https://www.softwares.com/software/chargeb