enue/best-chargebee-alternatives\"},{\"title\":\"Table of Content\",\"url\":\"https://flexprice.io/questions/chargebee-alternatives-for-ai-companies\"},{\"title\":\"Complete billing automation for (ambitiously) hybrid revenue workflows\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/retention/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Table of Content\",\"url\":\"https://flexprice.io/blog/what-is-chargebee\"},{\"title\":\"Table of Content\",\"url\":\"https://flexprice.io/questions/chargebee-recurring-billing-subscription-lifecycle\"},{\"title\":\"Bahasa Indonesia\",\"url\":\"https://resources.rework.com/id/tools/billing-revenue/best-chargebee-alternatives\"},{\"title\":\"chargebee pricing\",\"url\":\"https://www.agencyhandy.com/chargebee-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Chargebee pricing\",\"url\":\"https://www.softwares.com/software/chargebee/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Chargebee Pricing Plans & History (2026) — PricingSaaS\",\"url\":\"https://pricingsaas.com/companies/chargebee\"},{\"title\":\"All Chargebee Plans & Pricing\",\"url\":\"https://costbench.com/software/subscription-billing/chargebee/\"},{\"title\":\"www.g2.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.g2.com/products/chargebee/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"toolradar.com\",\"url\":\"https://toolradar.com/tools/chargebee/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Chargebee Pricing Calculator 2026\",\"url\":\"https://costbench.com/software/subscription-billing/chargebee/calculator/\"},{\"title\":\"chargebee vs memberful\",\"url\":\"https://getpulsesignal.com/compare/chargebee-vs-memberful\"}]\n\nChargebee's Flow plan pay-as-you-go option has no free threshold. The free allowance you're thinking of belonged to the older Starter plan.\n\n- **Flow pay-as-you-go:** Sources put it at 0.80% of monthly billing value with no platform fee and no free threshold. Flow — Pay as you go: 0.80% of monthly billing value, $0 platform fee, no free threshold.\n- **Flow commit option:** $99/mo platform fee plus 0.65% of monthly billing value. Both include 100M usage events/mo.\n- **Starter (now retired):** The free tier covered the first $250K of cumulative billing, then 0.75%. Chargebee replaced its Starter (free to $250K cumulative billing) and Performance ($7,188/yr) tiers with a single Flow plan, which is the change that ended the free entry threshold.\n- **Conflicting listings:** Some aggregators still describe a free plan. One says Chargebee has a free plan; Growth costs $99/mo. Another, checked October 11, 2026, says Chargebee has no free plan; Enterprise is quoted by sales. The later and more specific sources favor the no-free-tier reading.\n\nI did not reach Chargebee's official pricing page directly. The details above come from third-party trackers and one Chargebee retention-page snippet, so check chargebee.com/pricing before relying on the numbers.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B6SoNnN6QScupNwQm6fD1r","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[computer:left_click] Clicked at (100, 780)"},{"type":"text","text":"[computer:wait] Waited for 2 seconds"},{"type":"text","text":"[computer:screenshot] Successfully captured screenshot (896x487, jpeg) - ID: ss_8892dwu06 — 0.6-scale view; coordinate frame: 1493x812."},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/jpeg","data":""}},{"type":"text","text":"[Image: source: /Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79/tool-results/mcp-claude-in-chrome-blob-1794346968983-068uwf.jpg]"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: 268836818\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId 268836817: \"JusPrin\" (\"https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/web/done\")\n  • tabId 268836818: \"Dashboards - Chargebee\" (\"https://jusprinv2-test.chargebee.com/dashboards\")\n  • tabId 268836821: \"Log in to your PayPal account\" (\"https://www.paypal.com/signin?returnUri=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.paypal.com%2Fbusinessmanage%2Faccount%2FaboutBusiness\")\n