{"parentUuid":"91f4aec2-4378-481d-a7ab-1765d47bc688","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"810e949a-0f33-435b-b5d5-695268e1a569","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HNjYn82JyYsyKCdXuoepEM","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[computer:left_click] Clicked at (268, 750)"},{"type":"text","text":"[computer:wait] Waited for 3 seconds"},{"type":"text","text":"[get_page_text] Title: Users - Chargebee\nURL: https://jusprinv2-test.chargebee.com/users/edit_account#account-details\nSource element: <body>\n---\nBilling\njusprinv2\nTest\njusprinv2-test.chargebee.com\nGo to\n⌘\nK\nHome\nCustomers\nSubscriptions\nInvoices & Credit Notes\nQuotes\nProduct Catalog\nUsages\nNEW\nEntitlements\nLogs\nReceivables\nNEW\nRevenueStory\nClassic Reports\nApps\nSettings\nConfigure Chargebee\nImport & Export Data\nTeam Members\nChargebee Notifications\nSecurity\nSet up Chargebee\nYour pricing, set up in minutes\nWhat's new\nNeed Help?\nKE\nKenneth\nk@thespaghettidetective.com\nTest site — Safe to simulate and experiment\nConfigure Chargebee\nMy account\nAccount details\nK\nKenneth\nk@thespaghettidetective.com\nEdit Profile\nApp Language\nPlease note that this does not affect the language of your customer interactions. To enable multilingual support for your customers, including invoices, credit notes, emails, checkout and portal language preferences, head to Configure Chargebee > Languages\n\nEnglish\nPassword last changed 2 months ago\nChange Password\n\nTwo-factor authentication\nEnable\nPermissions\nSubscribe to periodic newsletters, emails about usage tips, billing practices, and other communications from Chargebee\n\ntrue\nConnected MCP clients\n\nReview MCP clients you have granted access to Chargebee MCP and revoke access when needed.\n\nNo connected MCP clients found\nYou have not connected any MCP clients.\nRevoking access will immediately block the connected client from accessing your MCP resources.\nAuthentication Settings\nChargebee supports Single Sign-On (SSO) and two-factor authentication for all users of this site.\nGo to Security\nPrivacy Terms"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: 268836818\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId 268836817: \"JusPrin\" (\"https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/web/done\")\n  • tabId 268836818: \"Users - Chargebee\" (\"https://jusprinv2-test.chargebee.com/users/edit_account#account-details\")\n  • tabId 268836821: \"Log in to your PayPal account\" (\"https://www.paypal.com/signin?returnUri=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.paypal.com%2Fbusinessmanage%2Faccount%2FaboutBusiness\")\n  • tabId 268836847: \"Transactions – TSD Technology, LLC – Stripe\" (\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1CrFhqLPS4omY4v8/payments/REDACTED\")"}]}]},"uuid":"4e4d958d-3468-4771-8ca7-124b19038c40","timestamp":"2026-11-10T21:42:57.696Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"[computer:left_click] Clicked at (268, 750)"},{"type":"text","text":"[computer:wait] Waited for 3 seconds"},{"type":"text","text":"[get_page_text] Title: Users - Chargebee\nURL: https://jusprinv2-test.chargebee.com/users/edit_account#account-details\nSource element: <body>\n---\nBilling\njusprinv2\nTest\njusprinv2-test.chargebee.com\nGo to\n⌘\nK\nHome\nCustomers\nSubscriptions\nInvoices & Credit Notes\nQuotes\nProduct Catalog\nUsages\nNEW\nEntitlements\nLogs\nReceivables\nNEW\nRevenueStory\nClassic Reports\nApps\nSettings\nConfigure Chargebee\nImport & Export Data\nTeam Members\nChargebee Notifications\nSecurity\nSet up Chargebee\nYour pricing, set up in minutes\nWhat's new\nNeed Help?\nKE\nKenneth\nk@thespaghettidetective.com\nTest site — Safe to simulate and experiment\nConfigure Chargebee\nMy account\nAccount details\nK\nKenneth\nk@thespaghettidetective.com\nEdit Profile\nApp Language\nPlease note that this does not affect the language of your customer interactions. To enable multilingual support for your customers, including invoices, credit notes, emails, checkout and portal language preferences, head to Configure Chargebee > Languages\n\nEnglish\nPassword last changed 2 months ago\nChange Password\n\nTwo-factor authentication\nEnable\nPermissions\nSubscribe to periodic newsletters, emails about usage tips, billing practices, and other communications from Chargebee\n\ntrue\nConnected MCP clients\n\nReview MCP clients you have granted access to Chargebee MCP and revoke access when needed.\n\nNo connected MCP clients found\nYou have not connected any MCP clients.\nRevoking access will immediately block the connected client from accessing your MCP resources.\nAuthentication Settings\nChargebee supports Single Sign-On (SSO) and two-factor authentication for all users of this site.\nGo to Security\nPrivacy Terms"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: 268836818\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId 268836817: \"JusPrin\" (\"https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/web/done\")\n  • tabId 268836818: \"Users - Chargebee\" (\"https://jusprinv2-test.chargebee.com/users/edit_account#account-details\")\n  • tabId 268836821: \"Log in to your PayPal account\" (\"https://www.paypal.com/signin?returnUri=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.paypal.com%2Fbusinessmanage%2Faccount%2FaboutBusiness\")\n  • tabId 268836847: \"Transactions – TSD Technology, LLC – Stripe\" (\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1CrFhqLPS4omY4v8/payments/REDACTED\")"}],"classifierBoundary":true,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"91f4aec2-4378-481d-a7ab-1765d47bc688","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
