{"parentUuid":"7cc61f68-cd1d-4b01-b5d0-360a15f84dbb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"1878ed12-3b45-49de-a8a9-e4ddee9fabce","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MsV4v3hic4hqohSbE4AyF4","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[computer:left_click] Clicked at (474, 77)"},{"type":"text","text":"[computer:wait] Waited for 3 seconds"},{"type":"text","text":"[get_page_text] Title: Checkout Portal - Chargebee\nURL: https://jusprinv2.chargebee.com/checkout_and_portal_settings/fields\nSource element: <body>\n---\nBilling\nTSD Technology, LLC\nLive\njusprinv2.chargebee.com\nGo to\n⌘\nK\nHome\nCustomers\nSubscriptions\nInvoices & Credit Notes\nProduct Catalog\nEntitlements\nLogs\nReceivables\nNEW\nRevenueStory\nClassic Reports\nApps\nSettings\nConfigure Chargebee\nImport & Export Data\nTeam Members\nChargebee Notifications\nSecurity\nWhat's new\nNeed Help?\nJS\nJusPrin Support\njusprin-support@obico.io\nConfigure Chargebee\nCheckout & Self-Serve Portal\nCustomize Chargebee's checkout and customers' self-serve portal. Learn more\nDiscard Draft\nPublish\nLayout\nConfiguration\nFields\nLabels\nINTEGRATE WITH CHARGEBEE\nDiscard Draft\nPublish\nAccount Information\nCustom fields for subscription\nBilling\nShipping\nPayments\nLegal Agreements\nConsent Information\n\nPreview the changes you make to your Checkout and Portal here\n\nPreview Checkout/Portal\n\nPreview Action Pages\n\nAccount information\nCheckout will be disabled immediately. Customers can no longer see the Chargebee checkout.\nDisable\nFirst Name\ntrue\nLast Name\ntrue\nEmail*\ntrue\nCompany\nfalse\nPhone\nfalse\nAdd/Manage Custom Fields\nCustom fields for subscription\nConfigure the subscription-related information you collect from customers. Add, remove, or rearrange fields to suit your business requirements.\nAdd/Manage Custom Fields\nBilling\nCollect billing information from your customers. Add, remove, or rearrange fields as you’d like customers to see on the checkout pages.\nDisable\nFirst Name*\ntrue\nLast Name*\ntrue\nEmail\nfalse\nPhone\nfalse\nCompany\nfalse\nVAT Number\nPlease check tax documentation on how to enable this. Billing country should be made mandatory to enable this.\nfalse\nI have registered for GST\nPlease check tax documentation on how to enable this. Billing country should be made mandatory to enable this.\nfalse\nE-Invoicing Fields\nCollect entity identifier information from customers during checkout to send e-invoices via a secure e-invoicing network.\nfalse\nAddress Fields\nAddress Line1, Address Line2, City, Zip, State, Country\ntrue\nAddress Line1*\ntrue\nAddress Line2\ntrue\nAddress Line3\nfalse\nCity*\ntrue\nZip\ntrue\nState*\ntrue\nCountry*\ntrue\nShow billing address in\nBoth checkout and portal\nShipping\nCollect your customers' shipping information.\nDisable\nUse the same configuration as billing\ntrue\nIn checkout, show the option \"Ship to my billing address\"\ntrue\nPayments\nCard Details : Collect credit card details from your customers.\nFirst Name\nfalse\nLast Name\nfalse\nNumber*\ntrue\nExpiry*\ntrue\nCvv*\ntrue\nAddress Fields\n-\nfalse\nAddress Line1\nfalse\nAddress Line2\nfalse\nCity\nfalse\nZip\nfalse\nState\nfalse\nCountry\nfalse\nIn checkout, prefill address information from\nNone\nBank Details\nThe following mandatory fields will be shown if ACH is enabled : Name of the Account Holder, Account Number, Routing Number, Name of the Bank, Type of Account, Account Holder Type\nLegal Agreements\nDisplay and link agreements to the Terms and Privacy notice that customers consent to during checkout.\nAdd legal agreement\nConsent Information\nCollect consent from your customers. Add consent agreement labels, and set up consent checkboxes in the Chargebee Checkout, and Self-Serve Portal.\nGo to Consent Management →\nPrivacy Terms\nBuild no code pricing tables"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: 268836873\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId 268836817: \"JusPrin\" (\"https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/web/done\")\n  • tabId 268836818: \"Checkout Portal - Chargebee\" (\"https://jusprinv2-test.chargebee.com/checkout_and_portal_settings/configuration\")\n  • tabId 268836821: \"Log in to your PayPal account\" (\"https://www.paypal.com/signin?returnUri=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.paypal.com%2Fbusinessmanage%2Faccount%2FaboutBusiness\")\n  • tabId 268836847: \"Transactions – TSD Technology, LLC – Stripe\" (\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1CrFhqLPS4omY4v8/payments/REDACTED\")\n  • tabId 268836873: \"Checkout Portal - Chargebee\" (\"https://jusprinv2.chargebee.com/checkout_and_portal_settings/fields\")"}]}]},"uuid":"f825d60d-831c-4e55-8ad4-a9e670677cd6","timestamp":"2026-11-11T00:23:12.514Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"[computer:left_click] Clicked at (474, 77)"},{"type":"text","text":"[computer:wait] Waited for 3 seconds"},{"type":"text","text":"[get_page_text] Title: Checkout Portal - Chargebee\nURL: https://jusprinv2.chargebee.com/checkout_and_portal_settings/fields\nSource element: <body>\n---\nBilling\nTSD Technology, LLC\nLive\njusprinv2.chargebee.com\nGo to\n⌘\nK\nHome\nCustomers\nSubscriptions\nInvoices & Credit Notes\nProduct Catalog\nEntitlements\nLogs\nReceivables\nNEW\nRevenueStory\nClassic Reports\nApps\nSettings\nConfigure Chargebee\nImport & Export Data\nTeam Members\nChargebee Notifications\nSecurity\nWhat's new\nNeed Help?\nJS\nJusPrin Support\njusprin-support@obico.io\nConfigure Chargebee\nCheckout & Self-Serve Portal\nCustomize Chargebee's checkout and customers' self-serve portal. Learn more\nDiscard Draft\nPublish\nLayout\nConfiguration\nFields\nLabels\nINTEGRATE WITH CHARGEBEE\nDiscard Draft\nPublish\nAccount Information\nCustom fields for subscription\nBilling\nShipping\nPayments\nLegal Agreements\nConsent Information\n\nPreview the changes you make to your Checkout and Portal here\n\nPreview Checkout/Portal\n\nPreview Action Pages\n\nAccount information\nCheckout will be disabled immediately. Custo