{"parentUuid":"1e375ebb-826b-4beb-b546-31f8e54cab3d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"1878ed12-3b45-49de-a8a9-e4ddee9fabce","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FfyLvGEtfLUggALGVMKja2","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[navigate] Navigated to https://jusprinv2.chargebee.com/payment_gateways"},{"type":"text","text":"[computer:wait] Waited for 5 seconds"},{"type":"text","text":"[get_page_text] Title: Payment Gateways - Chargebee\nURL: https://jusprinv2.chargebee.com/payment_gateways\nSource element: <body>\n---\nBilling\nTSD Technology, LLC\nLive\njusprinv2.chargebee.com\nGo to\n⌘\nK\nHome\nCustomers\nSubscriptions\nInvoices & Credit Notes\nProduct Catalog\nEntitlements\nLogs\nReceivables\nNEW\nRevenueStory\nClassic Reports\nApps\nSettings\nConfigure Chargebee\nImport & Export Data\nTeam Members\nChargebee Notifications\nSecurity\nWhat's new\nNeed Help?\nJS\nJusPrin Support\njusprin-support@obico.io\nConfigure Chargebee\nPayment Gateways\nAdd Gateway\nStrong Customer Authentication (SCA)\nEnable 3D Secure to comply with SCA regulations. You have currently enabled it for 0 gateways.\nCurrently, Chargebee supports 3D Secure for Stripe, PayPal, Adyen, Braintree, CyberSource, Checkout.com, BlueSnap, Worldline Online Payments, Pay.com, Mollie, Razorpay, Chargebee Pay, EBANX, Nuvei, J.P. Morgan Mobility Payment Solutions, and Paystack.\nYou can configure 3D Secure under gateways settings\nYou haven't configured gateways yet...\nPick a gateway from below or click\nADD A GATEWAY to get started.\nConfigure payment gateways\nAdyen\nPreferred Partner\nThe enterprise partner for advanced processing needs in multiple regions.\nStripe\nPreferred Partner\nThe best way to accept payments online and in mobile apps.\nGoCardless\nPreferred Direct Debit Partner\nMakes Direct Debit easy for everyone from individuals to multi-national corporations.\nCheckout.com\nPreferred Partner\nA unified platform for all online payment processing needs across the world.\nMollie\nPreferred Partner for EU\nEnjoy effortless setup and start accepting localised European payment methods.\nPayPal\nAdd PayPal as a payment option to your checkout to improve sales.\nBraintree\nAuthorize.net\nWorldPay\nElavon\nNMI\nAmazon Pay\nBlueSnap\nCyberSource\nWorldpay US eCom (Vantiv Litle)\nWorldline Online Payments\n(Formerly known as Ingenico)\nExact Payments\nQuickBooks Payments\nRazorpay\nGlobal Payments\nBank of America\nPay.com\nEBANX\nDlocal\nPaystack\nCan't find the gateway you want?\nSmart Routing ACTIVE\nSelect the most optimal gateway by payment method and currency. Learn more\nManage Rules\nPayment Optimization INACTIVE\nOptimize your payment processing specific to your business needs. Create custom rules for payment method display, verification, and routing tailored to specific payment scenarios.\nManage Settings\nSet As Active\nPrivacy Terms"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: 268836873\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId 268836817: \"JusPrin\" (\"https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/web/done\")\n  • tabId 268836818: \"Checkout Portal - Chargebee\" (\"https://jusprinv2-test.chargebee.com/checkout_and_portal_settings/configuration\")\n  • tabId 268836821: \"Log in to your PayPal account\" (\"https://www.paypal.com/signin?returnUri=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.paypal.com%2Fbusinessmanage%2Faccount%2FaboutBusiness\")\n  • tabId 268836847: \"Transactions – TSD Technology, LLC – Stripe\" (\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1CrFhqLPS4omY4v8/payments/REDACTED\")\n  • tabId 268836873: \"Payment Gateways - Chargebee\" (\"https://jusprinv2.chargebee.com/payment_gateways\")"}]}]},"uuid":"e7ee3285-92d2-443f-8e8c-4ea83afaa9d5","timestamp":"2026-11-11T00:29:27.756Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"[navigate] Navigated to https://jusprinv2.chargebee.com/payment_gateways"},{"type":"text","text":"[computer:wait] Waited for 5 seconds"},{"type":"text","text":"[get_page_text] Title: Payment Gateways - Chargebee\nURL: https://jusprinv2.chargebee.com/payment_gateways\nSource element: <body>\n---\nBilling\nTSD Technology, LLC\nLive\njusprinv2.chargebee.com\nGo to\n⌘\nK\nHome\nCustomers\nSubscriptions\nInvoices & Credit Notes\nProduct Catalog\nEntitlements\nLogs\nReceivables\nNEW\nRevenueStory\nClassic Reports\nApps\nSettings\nConfigure Chargebee\nImport & Export Data\nTeam Members\nChargebee Notifications\nSecurity\nWhat's new\nNeed Help?\nJS\nJusPrin Support\njusprin-support@obico.io\nConfigure Chargebee\nPayment Gateways\nAdd Gateway\nStrong Customer Authentication (SCA)\nEnable 3D Secure to comply with SCA regulations. You have currently enabled it for 0 gateways.\nCurrently, Chargebee supports 3D Secure for Stripe, PayPal, Adyen, Braintree, CyberSource, Checkout.com, BlueSnap, Worldline Online Payments, Pay.com, Mollie, Razorpay, Chargebee Pay, EBANX, Nuvei, J.P. Morgan Mobility Payment Solutions, and Paystack.\nYou can configure 3D Secure under gateways settings\nYou haven't configured gateways yet...\nPick a gateway from below or click\nADD A GATEWAY to get started.\nConfigure payment gateways\nAdyen\nPreferred Partner\nThe enterprise partner for advanced processing needs in multiple regions.\nStripe\nPreferred Partner\nThe best way to accept payments online and in mobile apps.\nGoCardless\nPreferred Direct Debit Partner\nMakes Direct Debit easy for everyone from individuals to multi-national corporations.\nCheckout.com\nPreferred Partner\nA unified platform for all online payment processing needs across the world.\nMollie\nPreferred Partner for EU\nEnjoy effortless setup and start accepting localised European payment methods.\nPayPal\nAdd PayPal as a payment option to your checkout to improve sales.\nBraintree\nAuthorize.net\nWorldPay\nElavon\nNMI\nAmazon Pay\nBlueSnap\nCyberSource\nWorldpay US eCom (Vantiv Litle)\nWorldline Online Payments\n(Formerly known as Ingenico)\nExact Payments\nQuickBooks Payments\nRazorpay\nGlobal Payments\nBank of America\nPay.com\nEBANX\nDlocal\nPaystack\nCan't find the gateway you want?\nSmart Routing ACTIVE\nSelect the most optimal gateway by payment method and currency. Learn more\nManage Rules\nPayment Optimization INACTIVE\nOptimize your payment processing specific to your business needs. Create custom rules for payment method display, verification, and routing tailored to specific payment scenarios.\nManage Settings\nSet As Active\nPrivacy Terms"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: 268836873\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId 268836817: \"JusPrin\" (\"https://jusprinv2-stg.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/web/done\")\n  • tabId 268836818: \"Checkout Portal - Chargebee\" (\"https://jusprinv2-test.chargebee.com/checkout_and_portal_settings/configuration\")\n  • tabId 268836821: \"Log in to your PayPal account\" (\"https://www.paypal.com/signin?returnUri=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.paypal.com%2Fbusinessmanage%2Faccount%2FaboutBusiness\")\n  • tabId 268836847: \"Transactions – TSD Technology, LLC – Stripe\" (\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1CrFhqLPS4omY4v8/payments/REDACTED\")\n  • tabId 268836873: \"Payment Gateways - Chargebee\" (\"https://jusprinv2.chargebee.com/payment_gateways\")"}],"classifierBoundary":true,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1e375ebb-826b-4beb-b546-31f8e54cab3d","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/private/tmp/claude/claude-502/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79/scratchpad","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
