{"parentUuid":"f98a2242-3466-4d5a-a899-50136b8eaabb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgvCfny78kUArsEWbz8RC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've copied everything that can be copied without your sign-in from the test site (jusprinv2-test) to the live site (jusprinv2). Nobody can buy yet, because no payment provider is connected and production doesn't have the new server code.\n\n**What now matches the test site:**\n- **Catalog:** both plans, the credit pack, and the 20%-off coupon for Obico Premium subscribers.\n- **Checkout:** same checkout settings, and no billing address is asked.\n- **Look:** JusPrin's logo and colors.\n- **Emails:** they already matched. Both sites send from \"JusPrin Support <jusprin-support@obico.io>\" and use the same template with the JusPrin logo.\n\n**One email I didn't copy:** the test site sends \"Thanks for signing up, welcome aboard!\" whenever a Chargebee customer is created. Our server creates that customer when someone clicks a buy button, before they pay. On the live site, everyone who opened checkout and then left would get that email, so I left it off there. Every other automatic email is off on both sites, receipts included.\n\n**The \"Jusprin-support\" sign-off:** it isn't one shared setting. Each email has its own copy of the text. Since no email is switched on, no customer sees it. I'll fix it in any email you decide to switch on.\n\n**Your turn: Stripe.** In your Chrome, the live site's Payment Gateways tab shows the \"Connect with Stripe\" window. Click \"Connect to an existing account\" and sign in to TSD's Stripe account. That step gives Chargebee access to TSD's Stripe, so it's yours to click.\n\n**After Stripe:**\n1. I'll open PayPal's connect page the same way, for you to sign in to TSD's PayPal business account.\n2. I'll set up the routing so PayPal payments go to PayPal and card payments go to Stripe, as on the test site.\n3. I'll set \"JUSPRIN\" as the name on customers' card statements.\n\n**Webhook and deploy:** I'll add the live webhook, `https://app.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/cb_webhook`, just before the deploy. Production doesn't have that address yet, so if I add it earlier, Chargebee's calls to it fail. The deploy itself will get its own question."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1222,"cache_read_input_tokens":137432,"output_tokens":743,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1222,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":743,"cache_read_input_tokens":137432,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1222,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1222},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgvCfnjisSVnx4zwiKuAZ","requestRef":"25b75851-34e7-4fea-82a5-df02a53a69e5","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"bfa21881-e214-45df-beaa-bb1b698afb2b","timestamp":"2026-11-11T00:34:30.883Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/ops","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
