{"parentUuid":"7f6a8e85-eadc-4187-be13-7a94d6d15b1b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgvE1WGhHT2BBCD4YcRo9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The session planning how to handle JusPrin 1 users and the Obico subscriber discount ([Plan JusPrin 1 user handling and the Obico subscriber discount](#local_87a60f59-f953-4ea7-b0fb-1f96b66823b6)) changed the test site after I copied it. With your approval it added:\n- yearly Hobby ($100/year) and Workshop ($200/year) prices\n- a coupon that makes a moved JusPrin 1 user's first year of yearly Hobby free\n- the two yearly prices to the 20%-off Obico Premium coupon\n\nSo the live site no longer matches the test site on those items. I'm leaving the live site as it is: they belong to that session's plan, and it says it changed only the test site. I wrote this in the shared notes so the items get copied to the live site once that plan is settled.\n\nNothing else has changed. The \"Connect with PayPal\" window is still open on the live site's tab in your Chrome. Once you've signed in to TSD's PayPal business account through it, I'll check the connection the same way I checked Stripe."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":369,"cache_read_input_tokens":179109,"output_tokens":352,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":369,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":352,"cache_read_input_tokens":179109,"cache_creation_input_tokens":369,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":369},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockInd