{"parentUuid":"8b3b58dc-0ec7-4820-a93d-de11073b8190","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8b62fff6-0c2e-40cf-8d44-e3e368595e78","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VdaqsPemdthv6KLoEnQRL3","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Title: Payment Gateways - Chargebee\nURL: https://jusprinv2.chargebee.com/payment_gateways\nSource element: <body>\n---\nBilling\nTSD Technology, LLC\nLive\njusprinv2.chargebee.com\nGo to\n⌘\nK\nHome\nCustomers\nSubscriptions\nInvoices & Credit Notes\nProduct Catalog\nEntitlements\nLogs\nReceivables\nNEW\nRevenueStory\nClassic Reports\nApps\nSettings\nConfigure Chargebee\nImport & Export Data\nTeam Members\nChargebee Notifications\nSecurity\nWhat's new\nNeed Help?\nJS\nJusPrin Support\njusprin-support@obico.io\nConfigure Chargebee\nPayment Gateways (2)\nAdd Gateway\nStrong Customer Authentication (SCA)\nEnable 3D Secure to comply with SCA regulations. You have currently enabled it for 0 gateways.\nCurrently, Chargebee supports 3D Secure for Stripe, PayPal, Adyen, Braintree, CyberSource, Checkout.com, BlueSnap, Worldline Online Payments, Pay.com, Mollie, Razorpay, Chargebee Pay, EBANX, Nuvei, J.P. Morgan Mobility Payment Solutions, and Paystack.\nYou can configure 3D Secure under gateways settings\n\nStripe-1\n\nPaypal-1\n\nSmart Routing ACTIVE\nSelect the most optimal gateway by payment method and currency. Learn more\nManage Rules\nPayment Optimization INACTIVE\nOptimize your payment processing specific to your business needs. Create custom rules for payment method display, verification, and routing tailored to specific payment scenarios.\nManage Settings\nSet As Active\nPayment Preferences\nCustomise your payment gateway behaviour with optional settings. Tailor the integration to your unique business workflows.\nManage Settings\nLearn More\nPrivacy Terms"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: 268836914\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId 268836914: \"Payment Gateways - Chargebee\" (\"https://jusprinv2.chargebee.com/payment_gateways\")\n  • tabId 268836915: \"Dashboard – TSD Technology, LLC – Stripe\" (\"https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1CrFhqLPS4omY4v8/workbench/events?type=account.application.authorized\")"}]}]},"uuid":"973ce5ad-a20f-4ee9-a191-3cd0bed7a7eb","timestamp":"2026-11-11T00:53:02.993Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"Title: Payment Gateways - Chargebee\nURL: https://jusprinv2.chargebee.com/payment_gateways\nSource element: <body>\n---\nBilling\nTSD Technology, LLC\nLive\njusprinv2.chargebee.com\nGo to\n⌘\nK\nHome\nCustomers\nSubscriptions\nInvoices & Credit Notes\nProduct Catalog\nEntitlements\nLogs\nReceivables\nNEW\nRevenueStory\nClassic Reports\nApps\nSettings\nConfigure Chargebee\nImport & Export Data\nTeam Members\nChargebee Notifications\nSecurity\nWhat's new\nNeed Help?\nJS\nJusPrin Support\njusprin-support@obico.io\nConfigure Chargebee\nPayment Gateways (2)\nAdd Gateway\nStrong Customer Authentication (SCA)\nEnable 3D Secure to comply with SCA regulations. You have currently enabled it for 0 gateways.\nCurrently, Chargebee supports 3D Secure for Stripe, PayPal, Adyen, Braintree, CyberSource, Checkout.com, BlueSnap, Worldline Online Payments, Pay.com, Mollie, Razorpay, Chargebee Pay, EBANX, Nuvei, J.P. Morgan Mobility Payment Solutions, and Paystack.\nYou can configure 3D Secure under gateways settings\n\nStripe-1\n\nPaypal-1\n\nSmart Routing ACTIVE\nSelect the most optimal gateway by payment method and currency. Learn more\nManage Rules\nPayment Optimization INACTIVE\nOptimize your payment processing specific to your business needs. Create custom rules for payment method display, verification, and routing tailored to specific payment scenarios.\nManage Settings\nSet As Active\nPayment Preferences\nCustomise your payment gateway behaviour with optional settings. Tailor the integration to your unique business workflows.\nManage Settings\nLearn More\nPrivacy Terms"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nTab Context:\n- Ex