{"parentUuid":"8047a145-cbba-44a2-a414-5a1c845dfba1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgvF7WBGZPXyaoMS6z9PJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The session that set up JusPrin 2's server host has answered the Google sign-in question. Meanwhile, the production rollout has 6 of 9 web pods on the new version and is still going.\n\n**Why production still uses Obico's Google app:** nobody skipped it and nothing blocked it. The order of events explains it:\n1. Production's jusprinv2.obico.io was set up at 7:45 PM Pacific on Nov 9. The agreed procedure at the time, in the ops runbook, used a command that puts Obico's Google app on the new site on purpose.\n2. You added jusprinv2.obico.io to Obico's Google sign-in settings yourself. Google sign-up then worked in the production smoke test.\n3. JusPrin got its own Google app, \"JusPrin 2 server\" in the Google Cloud project `jusprin`, about 14 hours later, on Nov 10 at 10:12 AM Pacific. Only staging was switched over to it then.\n\n**What switching production takes** (from section 2 of `docs/jusprin2-host-setup.md` in tsd-enterprise):\n1. In production's Django admin, add a Google sign-in app named \"JusPrin Google\" with JusPrin's client ID and its secret, ticked for jusprinv2.obico.io only. You'd paste the secret, from wherever it was saved, or make a new one in the Google Cloud console.\n2. Untick jusprinv2.obico.io on Obico's Google app. The sign-in library refuses a site that two Google apps serve.\n\nIt also flagged that lines 110–111 of `tsd/RUNBOOK.md` in the ops repo still give the old command. They should point to that doc section instead, and whoever does the switch should fix them.\n\nI'll come back to this after the rollout, with the webhook and the purchase test."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":385,"cache_read_input_tokens":228345,"output_tokens":590,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":385,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":590,"cache_read_input_tokens":228345,"cache_creation_input_tokens":385,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":385},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f0b64139-9a79-485c-8e38-ae9fd48b13f0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgvF7VqgMb7AHQBA1ofsW","requestRef":"413a37c8-8aa5-45fb-9d76-c6d44581c94c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"d8ec08d5-b6e6-4ca1-9ec0-4a3b494f5d74","timestamp":"2026-11-11T01:06:31.999Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/ops","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
