{"parentUuid":"f29bf34b-11c7-4a73-a89f-7470b22d10f1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e9204a25-2670-4a9c-a6c1-5f0039de6045","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nLinked sessions now (status, not an instruction): put-the-jusprin-2-server = local_2e8b84da-58b4-4ef1-bd87-b76f805fdf4d (idle); opt-in-before-jusprin-2 = local_5b5c4dae-b676-44e9-9c1a-7469fec69e96 (idle, started by put-the-jusprin-2-server); home-shows-stale-credits = local_afbc5de2-baa6-429c-8931-f6dc91d5bc32 (idle, started by put-the-jusprin-2-server); plan-jusprin-1-user-hand = local_87a60f59-f953-4ea7-b0fb-1f96b66823b6 (working); add-skip-for-now-to-the = local_d4832d18-4b62-4c0c-925e-e47fe437c2e2 (idle). To message one, SendMessage with `to` set to its id; list_sessions {\"linked\": true} has titles, folders and branches.\n</system-reminder>\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<!-- reply 1 -->\n> It also flagged that lines 110–111 of tsd/RUNBOOK.md in the ops repo still give the old command. They should point to that doc section instead, and whoever does the switch should fix them.\n\ncoordiante with another session to make sure this is done correctly\n\n\n"}]},"uuid":"6bd68041-aac4-40fc-9557-f77d4ccc81b8","timestamp":"2026-11-11T01:13:50.643Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":40,"turnIndex":47},"clientPlatform":"desktop_app","turnAttributionKey":"6bd68041-aac4-40fc-9557-f77d4ccc81b8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/ops","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
