{"parentUuid":"5d9fb4f0-ed57-4784-b9b7-cefcb2cbdbfa","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgvFsxkRBDcjWsrkf7k6C","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The runbook fix is done and correct, and Google sign-in on jusprinv2.obico.io now uses JusPrin's own Google app. Both are confirmed against production.\n\n**The runbook fix:** the session that wrote the runbook, [Put the JusPrin 2 server host live in production](#local_2e8b84da-58b4-4ef1-bd87-b76f805fdf4d), made two commits to `tsd/RUNBOOK.md` in the ops repo, 518f49a and b2beb75, which I reviewed. They change only that file. The steps now:\n- keep the database fix a new server needs first, with the reason;\n- send people to `docs/jusprin2-host-setup.md` in tsd-enterprise instead of the removed setup command. Its section 1 creates the JusPrin 2 site, and section 2 adds JusPrin's Google sign-in app and removes the host from Obico's;\n- name JusPrin's own Google client, \"JusPrin 2 server\" in the Google Cloud project `jusprin`, as the place a new host's sign-in address must be added.\n\n**Production Google sign-in:** that session switched it earlier today with your go-ahead. I checked production's database: \"JusPrin Google\" now serves only jusprinv2.obico.io, and Obico's Google app serves only app.obico.io and app.thespaghettidetective.com. Opening Google sign-in on jusprinv2.obico.io sends you to Google with JusPrin's client ID.\n\n**A small gap that session found in the doc:** section 1 of `docs/jusprin2-host-setup.md` doesn't mention the database fix a new server needs before creating the JusPrin 2 site. The runbook has it, but the doc doesn't. That session has an unpushed doc commit in tsd-enterprise (5715329f4d), so I suggested it add the note there.\n\n**Deploy:** all five production server groups finished updating without errors.\n\n**Waiting on you:**\n- **The $10 credit-pack purchase** on jusprinv2.obico.io. The prices page is open in your Chrome. Your account should go from 488 to 1,488 credits.\n- **Pushing the ops repo.** It now has five commits waiting on you: the two earlier ones, my production change, and the two runbook commits."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1213,"cache_read_input_tokens":250010,"output_tokens":745,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1213,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":745,"cache_read_input_tokens":250010,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1213,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1213},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"41fd9592-f078-40be-9600-1b26ae8d24db","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgvFsxMqyMrLnAGMWFD1o","requestRef":"3162ce6f-74c1-4fe1-985c-d3090089b48c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"18be6c7c-f6d7-4352-bc35-2428dc38b87c","timestamp":"2026-11-11T01:16:36.706Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
