{"parentUuid":"5b9b46e9-4209-45f7-b20d-f48d2ff4bded","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgvG1ztsasPdZtJvvsJVk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The host setup doc's gap is fixed, and I checked the change. The session that set up JusPrin 2's server host, [Put the JusPrin 2 server host live in production](#local_2e8b84da-58b4-4ef1-bd87-b76f805fdf4d), committed it as tsd-enterprise 76d5b25d41.\n\n**What the commit changes:**\n- The section-1 code in `docs/jusprin2-host-setup.md` now starts by fixing the database's id counter for syndicates.\n- Without that fix, creating the JusPrin 2 syndicate on a new server fails with a duplicate id. Every server has this problem, because database migration 0077 creates the \"base\" syndicate with a fixed id of 1.\n- Running the fix again changes nothing, since it only moves the counter up to the highest id already in use. That session confirmed this on staging by printing the SQL without running it.\n\nThat session also corrected something I said: its earlier doc commit, 5715329f4d, had already been pushed with your yes, so the new commit sits on top of it.\n\n**Not pushed yet:**\n- tsd-enterprise is one commit ahead (this doc fix).\n- The ops repo is five commits ahead.\n\nThe $10 credit-pack purchase on jusprinv2.obico.io is still waiting on you. Your account should go from 488 to 1,488 credits."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":415,"cache_read_input_tokens":253200,"output_tokens":444,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":415,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":444,"cache_read_input_tokens":253200,"cache_creation_input_tokens":415,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":415},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"31054b72-52d8-41cc-b179-c6f205831f58","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgvG1zckJf4AVfkSNtnf3","requestRef":"4ac3bffd-a826-4b17-8ce0-2c348d1336e8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"8b6a976b-d775-4ff8-a49a-0fe2067b7950","timestamp":"2026-11-11T01:18:23.285Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
