{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-11-11T01:43:08.777Z","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","content":"<cross-session-message from=\"local_3e38de32-e8df-4f8c-b26d-1a20db4c0aca\" from-name=\"Just Print V2 rollout plan\">\nKenneth wants to know whether a tsd-enterprise production release needs coordinating. Please reply to session local_3e38de32-e8df-4f8c-b26d-1a20db4c0aca with SendMessage, in a few lines; don't release anything.\n\nProduction and staging run obi.4104. tsd-enterprise master's newest commits are the yearly Hobby ($100) and Workshop ($200) plans with migration 0004, and a moved-customer price warning, both from the JusPrin 1 users session. Neither is released yet.\n\n1. Does the live `jusprinv2` Chargebee site have the yearly item prices those commits use? If not, what's missing, and does it need Kenneth's yes?\n2. Is any server change of yours (billing fixes, webhooks, email-template-related code) still unreleased or uncommitted?\n3. Is anything in Chargebee's live setup still unfinished that should be done before or after the next release?\n</cross-session-message>"}
