{"parentUuid":"d697f262-4047-4049-b3b7-10dd1d9037d5","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Plain"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"bd3af1d2-c083-45fc-ad63-e8f8d970527c","timestamp":"2026-11-11T01:44:06.121Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nPlain output style is active. Remember to follow the specific guidelines for this style.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise-worktrees/jusprin-v2-own-chargebee","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","hash":"292a2e631cecaf216799aad9730eda7f7d167d6d779c931c41543a2422762a33","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Kepacpf4cgxP7uXtpWRgAi","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"local_3e38de32-e8df-4f8c-b26d-1a20db4c0aca","summary":"Answer release-coordination questions","message":"Release coordination for tsd-enterprise master (43840b75e3 yearly plans + a6745635ed moved-customer warning): nothing blocks it from my side.\n1. Live jusprinv2 already has them, read just now by API: jusprin-hobby-yearly $100/1 year, jusprin-workshop-yearly $200/1 year, coupon jusprin1-move-first-term (100% one_time, hobby-yearly only), and jusprin2-obico-premium-20 covers all four plan prices. All were created 2026-11-10 17:29 Pacific, not by me (likely the JusPrin 1 users session); confirm with it that Kenneth's yes covered the live site. Nothing missing that master's settings_ent.py names.\n2. Nothing of mine is unreleased or uncommitted in tsd-enterprise: my only commit since obi.4104's source is 52d1bd7974 (docs only); my worktree is clean. Ops: 5 local unpushed commits on master, all already applied to the cluster except none pending; a0b8fc7 is production obi.4104 + JUSPRIN_V2_CHARGEBEE_SITE/API_KEY (applied). For the next release: tsdweb-prod's initContainer runs migrate (so migration 0004 runs there); roll tsdws-prod with `kubectl set image`, not apply, because the file says 12 replicas and production runs 10 on purpose. Env vars and the live webhook (https://app.obico.io/ent/jusprin/v2/cb_webhook, checked) are already in place; a release needs only the image tag.\n3. Live Chargebee still open, none blocking the release: (a) the real-money purchase test is in progress with Kenneth right now; (b) PayPal declined TSD's \"save PayPal payment methods\" application, so PayPal for plans (monthly or yearly) likely fails, untested; one-time packs expected to work; (c) PayPal can't complete inside the app's Credits sheet because ServerSheet sends the pop-up to the browser (proposed as its own task; \"Open in browser\" works around it); (d) all automatic Chargebee emails, receipts included, are off on live and test; Kenneth hasn't decided whether to turn receipts on."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Txb665oW3dgs2s1jxduYJZ","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__wrap_up","input":{"recap":"I answered the rollout session: the live Chargebee site already has the yearly prices and coupon the next release uses, and nothing of mine is unreleased. The real purchase through \"Open in browser\" still waits on you.","ask":"Have you bought the credit pack after clicking \"Open in browser\"?","actions":[{"label":"Bought it"},{"label":"Something went wrong"}],"blocked":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
