{"parentUuid":"3c68c98d-d196-49a9-89aa-98b59ff3c9f1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgvJHwj4FkbYtATE2qQmU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've told the PayPal fix session, [PayPal checkout fails inside the app's Credits sheet](#local_92607d89-53ce-49de-b66c-6c7f1e5b7f3f), to skip the card test and to reproduce and test on the Chargebee test site first.\n\n**What that involves:**\n- **Connecting PayPal to the test site.** The test site has no PayPal connected today; its purchases go through Chargebee's built-in pretend gateway. So the session first connects a PayPal *sandbox* business account, which is PayPal's practice environment. You'll need to sign in to PayPal for that step, and the session will open the page for you in Chrome. It will tell the rollout session before changing the test site.\n- **Using staging.** Its app copy will talk to staging and sign in to a staging account. It won't reuse the production copy you signed in to.\n- **No real money.** The payment will come from a sandbox buyer account.\n\nIt will only ask you about a production run once the test-site run works."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1206,"cache_read_input_tokens":308959,"output_tokens":322,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1206,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":322,"cache_read_input_tokens":308959,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1206,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1206},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"2e4844c8-848