ibrary/Application Support/JusPrin2-stg","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
{"parentUuid":"60c15e93-568c-4456-ace7-49bae6b36d14","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d3dfda83-168d-452b-a5de-7ffcfea41ecf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PjVEtjD51dZ25vqjvrjMAK","type":"tool_result","content":"---\nname: real-app-signed-in-without-screen-control\ndescription: \"Drive the real app signed in to a local gateway through an injected page script; which conf keys, why a copied binary dies, and what still needs the screen.\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: reference\n  originSessionId: f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c\n  modified: 2026-11-02T13:45:04.141Z\n---\n\nBuilds on [[live-host-check-via-instrumented-dev-page]]; used 2026-11-02 when screen control of the app was denied.\n\n- Signed-in conf needs all of: `jusprin_agent.{provider=jusprin, jusprin_api_key, enabled=true, cloud_consent=true, jusprin_model_formats=<JSON id→format from GET /ent/jusprin/v2/models>}`, `jusprin_server.base_url`, `jusprin_onboarding.status=completed`. Without the formats the Agent says \"not set up\".\n- An installed printer is `\"models\":[{\"vendor\":\"Custom\",\"model\":\"Generic Klipper Printer\",\"nozzle_diameter\":\"0.4\"}]`, not `vendors`.\n- Kill the app before editing the conf. Replace a scratch binary with `rm` then `cp`: `cp` over a binary that has run gets the new process killed at launch.\n- `Contents/Resources` in the build is a symlink to the worktree. Replace it with a real folder of links before corrupting a resource, or the worktree gets corrupted.\n- Bringing the app forward triggers an account refresh, so to race the gateway (a real 402), change the ledger and send without refocusing.\n- Page text input: native value setter plus an `input` event. A modal Preferences window's page polls as `agent-preferences`.\n- A test preset needs a `version` field or import rejects it.\n- A compose recreate drops env set by a wrapper; check `JUSPRIN_MODEL_ALIASES` before any chat so only the fake upstream is reachable.\n\nStill needs the screen: pointer hover, native file dialogs, Orca's wizard.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"fcc3f477-9169-40ff-a0fb-1cd235bb6a6d","timestamp":"2026-11-11T01:50:56.029Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"---\nname: real-app-signed-in-without-screen-control\ndescription: \"Drive the real app signed in to a local gateway through an injected page script; which conf keys, why a copied binary dies, and what still needs the screen.\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: reference\n  originSessionId: f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c\n  modified: 2026-11-02T13:45:04.141Z\n---\n\nBuilds on [[live-host-check-via-instrumented-dev-page]]; used 2026-11-02 when screen control of the app was denied.\n\n- Signed-in conf needs all of: `jusprin_agent.{provider=jusprin, jusprin_api_key, enabled=true, cloud_consent=true, jusprin_model_formats=<JSON id→format from GET /ent/jusprin/v2/models>}`, `jusprin_server.base_url`, `jusprin_onboarding.status=completed`. Without the formats the Agent says \"not set up\".\n- An installed printer is `\"models\":[{\"vendor\":\"Custom\",\"model\":\"Generic Klipper Printer\",\"nozzle_diameter\":\"0.4\"}]`, not `vendors`.\n- Kill the app before editing the conf. Replace a scratch binary with `rm` then `cp`: `cp` over a binary that has run gets the new process killed at launch.\n- `Contents/Resources` in the build is a symlink to the worktree. Replace it with a real folder of links before corrupting a resource, or the worktree gets corrupted.\n- Bringing the app forward triggers an account refresh, so to race the gateway (a real 402), change the ledger and send without refocusing.\n- Page text input: native value setter plus an `input` event. A modal Preferences window's page polls as `agent-preferences`.\n- A test preset needs a `version` field or import rejects it.\n- A compose recreate drops env set by a wrapper; check `JUSPRIN_MODEL_ALIASES` before any chat so only the fake upstream is reachable.\n\nStill needs the screen: pointer hover, native file dialogs, Orca's wizard.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"60c15e93-568c-4456-ace7-49bae6b36d14","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Library/Application Support/JusPrin2-stg","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
