{"parentUuid":"52fef36d-3f24-4888-b101-42f6a49433e1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgvJWsB4vWexEan8GTWyx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I was wrong earlier when I said the Chargebee test site had no PayPal. The PayPal fix session, [PayPal checkout fails inside the app's Credits sheet](#local_92607d89-53ce-49de-b66c-6c7f1e5b7f3f), found PayPal already connected there, in PayPal's sandbox mode where no real money moves. Either the page I looked at had loaded before it was connected, or I misread it. Either way, there's nothing to connect, and that session changed nothing on the test site.\n\n**What it needs from you once its build finishes (about 20 more minutes):**\n1. **Sign its test app copy in to staging.** Use Google or the emailed code, in the app's own sign-in form. You don't have a staging sign-in I could reuse: your staging settings folder (`JusPrin2-stg`) points at staging but isn't signed in.\n2. **Approve the payment in PayPal.** When PayPal's window opens inside the app, log in with a PayPal **sandbox buyer** account and approve. PayPal creates sandbox buyer accounts at developer.paypal.com, under the same sandbox business account the test site is connected to. Neither of us can type those credentials."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1063,"cache_read_input_tokens":315941,"output_tokens":392,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1063,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":392,"cache_read_input_tokens":315941,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1063,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1063},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b9ed65ff-f439-46a5-83cf-6c559e7052f4","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgvJWrti48wHrEGagQP86","requestRef":"66785f92-15bb-44a5-9fe3-fb3b18a21d25","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"e6731172-8bec-443e-8b6f-90ed7142dfcf","timestamp":"2026-11-11T01:51:08.123Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Library/Application Support/JusPrin2-stg","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
