ion. If what the user asked you here has steps left that these results unblock, carry on with them (message the session that has the context, or do the step here; a session's own branch is not in this checkout: merge it in only as \"Starting other sessions\" says, and if that section says nothing of merging, don't merge it, and tell the user the branch) and tell the user so in a line. Otherwise tell the user the outcome in one or two lines (with PR links if any). Start nothing the user did not ask for.</side-sessions-event>"},"uuid":"1251fcfa-9041-4bad-a55f-65eb630e7438","timestamp":"2026-11-11T01:55:14.421Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"host_synthetic","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":44,"turnIndex":60},"clientPlatform":"desktop_app","turnAttributionKey":"1251fcfa-9041-4bad-a55f-65eb630e7438","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Library/Application Support/JusPrin2-stg","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
