{"parentUuid":"9555efa4-1548-42a6-8670-d96497353707","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwGnuQEkZjK9CLVsCs5X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Production now runs server version `obi.4111`, released by the rollout session, [Just Print V2 rollout plan](#local_3e38de32-e8df-4f8c-b26d-1a20db4c0aca). It adds the yearly Hobby and Workshop plans, the warning shown to people moved from JusPrin 1 when switching would end their old price, and the list of JusPrin 1 users to move. That session reports it healthy, with no new errors in Sentry. The hold on releases is over.\n\nIt tested a yearly Hobby purchase on staging, and it went through correctly:\n- The price was $80: $100 minus the 20% Obico Premium discount.\n- The plan runs until 11 November 2027.\n- The account received 750 credits from the plan plus 750 from the launch offer.\n\nThat session also says your real-card purchase on production can go ahead. Since you've chosen to skip the card test, I'm leaving it. The only real-money test still possible is a PayPal payment on production, and that comes up only after the PayPal fix passes on the test site."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":276832,"cache_read_input_tokens":45001,"output_tokens":403,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":63},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":276832,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":403,"cache_read_input_tokens":45001,"cache_creation_input_tokens":276832,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":276832},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_f