{"parentUuid":"79b84377-04cd-4c66-a3a1-39ba189709d2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwS4xaxvaPyM2seGQN4o","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The PayPal fix session, [PayPal checkout fails inside the app's Credits sheet](#local_92607d89-53ce-49de-b66c-6c7f1e5b7f3f), says its tests are done on all three platforms. It has stopped both test machines and has nothing running against staging or production.\n\nIt also passed on news from the rollout session, [Just Print V2 rollout plan](#local_3e38de32-e8df-4f8c-b26d-1a20db4c0aca): a small server update is going out in the next half hour, staging first and then production. It changes only how the launch-offer bonus credits are stored, and it doesn't affect the PayPal fix.\n\nIts note doesn't say how the real PayPal sandbox payments on Windows and Linux went, or where the fix's code is (a branch or a pull request). That session has the details."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1222,"cache_read_input_tokens":342021,"output_tokens":313,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":41},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1222,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":313,"cache_read_input_tokens":342021,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1222,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1222},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c7e57983-5cc4-4442-97d3-ea12f835ff43","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgwS4xGNSvt1APp3T9wHs","requestRef":"b22056d9-2936-4e4b-b374-652ebe48846d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","