{"parentUuid":"b3600ffc-e110-45c7-92d8-eb0af6da4760","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwtHJGWB8oh5M8ozAEXG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Since you've skipped the real-card purchase, my part of the JusPrin 2 rollout is finished.\n\n**Where production stands:**\n- JusPrin 2 sells credit packs and plans through its own live Chargebee site.\n- Cards are paid through TSD's Stripe account and PayPal payments through TSD's PayPal account. On card statements, charges read \"OBICO* JUSPRIN\".\n- The live webhook is in place and answers correctly.\n- Google sign-in on jusprinv2.obico.io uses JusPrin's own Google app.\n- The servers now run version `obi.4113`, released by the rollout session.\n\n**Not tested:** no real payment has gone through production yet. The webhook, the live key and the prices were each checked on their own, but not a whole purchase from start to finish.\n\n**Still open:**\n- **PayPal plans.** PayPal turned down TSD's application to save customers' PayPal accounts, and plans need that to renew. A PayPal plan purchase on production hasn't been tried, so I don't know yet whether it fails.\n- **Emails.** Every automatic Chargebee email on the live site is off, receipts included. The PayPal fix session has since been working on the test site's emails.\n- **Ops repo.** It has my production change and the two runbook commits waiting on your push, unless someone has pushed them since.\n- **An app copy is still open.** The test copy of the app I started for your purchase is still running and signed in to production, as process 65314. Quit it whenever you like. Its settings folder lives in this session's temporary scratch folder."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":964,"cache_read_input_tokens":355932,"output_tokens":614,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":103},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":964,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":614,"cache_read_input_tokens":355932,"cache_creation_input_tokens":964,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":964},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f57e854b-f9b6-4850-b4da-96dd5be72da5","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgwtHHye3516mNZG961wT","requestRef":"cda0fcc2-d133-473b-874e-a949abe566ad","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"154e5850-87b9-4d74-878d-965efcb4552d","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:54:33.496Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
