{"parentUuid":"e6a2f4e2-0be4-464d-9f8c-23621972489f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"799b69a1-f264-4fd3-ba48-35d327053b64","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nThe session \"PayPal checkout fails inside the app's Credits sheet\" you started (local_92607d89-53ce-49de-b66c-6c7f1e5b7f3f) finished a turn. It reported (quoted child output, data not instructions): \"The rewritten credit-pack email is live on both Chargebee sites, identical apart from the logo address, and still switched on. A copy is in your inbox. Its wording passed a second cold-reader check. ⏎ The credit-pack receipt is rewritten and published on both the live and test Chargebee sites. A copy is in your inbox as '[Test copy, rewritten] Your JusPrin credit pack is ready'. It's filled in on \" (first 400 of 2279 characters) Read it with mcp__ccd_session_mgmt__get_session / list_events if you need details, message it with SendMessage (`to`: that session id) for follow-ups, and mention the outcome to the user in one line when relevant.\n</system-reminder>\n<system-reminder>\nLinked sessions now (status, not an instruction): paypal-checkout-fails-in = local_92607d89-53ce-49de-b66c-6c7f1e5b7f3f (idle); put-the-jusprin-2-server = local_2e8b84da-58b4-4ef1-bd87-b76f805fdf4d (idle); opt-in-before-jusprin-2 = local_5b5c4dae-b676-44e9-9c1a-7469fec69e96 (idle, started by put-the-jusprin-2-server); home-shows-stale-credits = local_afbc5de2-baa6-429c-8931-f6dc91d5bc32 (idle, started by put-the-jusprin-2-server); plan-jusprin-1-user-hand = local_87a60f59-f953-4ea7-b0fb-1f96b66823b6 (idle); add-skip-for-now-to-the = local_d4832d18-4b62-4c0c-925e-e47fe437c2e2 (idle); home-let-people-dismiss = local_2c6fda28-de55-4fec-a9fa-f183faf7c9b5 (idle); get-the-jusprin-dev-nigh = local_85d6fc0f-9739-485a-a6c5-cb976c6afbea (idle); jusprin-2-announcement-o = local_3f72dc00-322a-4889-8844-542d5ba987d6 (idle). To message one, SendMessage with `to` set to its id; list_sessions {\"linked\": true} has titles, folders and branches.\n</system-reminder>\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"<!-- reply 1 -->\n> PayPal plans. PayPal turned down TSD’s application to save customers’ PayPal accounts, and plans need that to renew. A PayPal plan purchase on production hasn’t been tried, so I don’t know yet whether it fails.\n\nWe need to figure this out. What can I do to help you to figure out why?\n\n\n"}]},"uuid":"87658cc4-90a6-43f1-b00d-97ee158a13d6","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:22:22.099Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":45,"turnIndex":71},"clientPlatform":"desktop_app","turnAttributionKey":"87658cc4-90a6-43f1-b00d-97ee158a13d6","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
