{"parentUuid":"a6a07470-f903-4eca-89ed-74903aa4335a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"799b69a1-f264-4fd3-ba48-35d327053b64","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013X2XDa7PrpvdLcUaN7p6sU","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Chargebee PayPal Commerce Platform vaulting not approved recurring subscriptions \"Save PayPal and Venmo payment methods\"\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Vaulted Payments\",\"url\":\"https://developer.paypal.com/braintree/docs/guides/paypal/vault/javascript/v2\"},{\"title\":\"PayPal Payments\",\"url\":\"https://docs.piano.io/en/subscriptions/paypal\"},{\"title\":\"• Resolved viclo\",\"url\":\"https://remarpro.com/support/topic/order-not-approved\"},{\"title\":\"Hi @heartharmony,\",\"url\":\"https://wordpress.org/support/topic/how-to-disable-paypal-for-subscriptions/\"},{\"title\":\"Vaulted payments\",\"url\":\"https://developer.paypal.com/braintree/graphql/integration_guides/paypal/vaulted-payments/\"},{\"title\":\"Save payment methods for recurring payments\",\"url\":\"https://developer.paypal.com/limited-release/commerce-platform/accept-payments/standard/customize/save-payment-methods-for-recurring-payments/\"},{\"title\":\"Vaulted Payments\",\"url\":\"https://developer.paypal.com/braintree/docs/guides/paypal/vault/ios/v6/\"},{\"title\":\"Vaulted Payments\",\"url\":\"https://developer.paypal.com/braintree/docs/guides/paypal/vault/ios/v7\"},{\"title\":\"recurring payments module\",\"url\":\"https://developer.paypal.com/limited-release/commerce-platform/accept-payments/standard/customize/recurring-payments-module.md\"},{\"title\":\"• Resolved rgkeenan\",\"url\":\"https://remarpro.com/support/?p=15469691\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up anything about Chargebee specifically, and I found no source with the exact phrase \"Save PayPal and Venmo payment methods.\" The results are about PayPal vaulting in general, and two of them describe failure patterns that could be relevant to your error.\n\n- **Vaulting is what makes recurring billing work.** PayPal's Braintree docs say vaulting lets a merchant charge a PayPal account later without the customer present, and list subscriptions as a typical use. (Vaulted payments with PayPal account will allow you to charge the account in the future without requiring your customer to be present during the transaction)\n- **Reference transactions must be enabled on the PayPal account.** Piano's integration notes that recurring PayPal payments depend on this, and that it's switched on automatically for successfully onboarded clients. (In order to run recurring transactions, reference transactions will be enabled by PayPal automatically on all successfully onboarded clients through Piano.) This is worth checking on your PayPal account if vaulting is refused.\n- **Vaulting can fail even when the payment succeeds.** A WooCommerce support thread reports that vaulting runs as a separate step from the payment, so the payment can succeed while saving the method fails. (Vaulting works asynchronously with the actual payment and saving the payment method being two separate steps. The former can be successful with the latter failing.)\n- **An \"order not approved\" error on a vaulted button** appeared in another WooCommerce thread, where the error showed up only when vaulting was enabled. The thread was closed without a clear fix. (This vaulted button UI is only observed when the Vaulting option is enabled)\n\nFor Chargebee specifically, you'd need to check its PayPal gateway documentation or contact its support, and PayPal's own support for the account's vaulting and reference transaction status.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"2c13a082-93a1-4660-b22b-16931e94f345","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:22:59.297Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Chargebee PayPal Commerce Platform vaulting not approved recurring subscriptions \"Save PayPal and Venmo payment methods\"","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01DDL4NGsqrJTSgF34Y9Kkfp","content":[{"title":"Vaulted Payments","url":"https://developer.paypal.com/braintree/docs/guides/paypal/vault/javascript/v2"},{"title":"PayPal Payments","url":"https://docs.piano.io/en/subscriptions/paypal"},{"title":"• Resolved viclo","url":"https://remarpro.com/support/topic/order-not-approved"},{"title":"Hi @heartharmony,","url":"https://wordpress.org/support/topic/how-to-disable-paypal-for-subscriptions/"},{"title":"Vaulted payments","url":"https://developer.paypal.com/braintree/graphql/integration_guides/paypal/vaulted-payments/"},{"title":"Save payment methods for recurring payments","url":"https://developer.paypal.com/limited-release/commerce-platform/accept-payments/standard/customize/save-payment-methods-for-recurring-payments/"},{"title":"Vaulted Payments","url":"https://developer.paypal.com/braintree/docs/guides/paypal/vault/ios/v6/"},{"title":"Vaulted Payments","url":"https://developer.paypal.com/braintree/docs/guides/paypal/vault/ios/v7"},{"title":"recurring payments module","url":"https://developer.paypal.com/limited-release/commerce-platform/accept-payments/standard/customize/recurring-payments-module.md"},{"title":"• Resolved rgkeenan","url":"https://remarpro.com/support/?p=15469691"}]},"The search didn't turn up anything about Chargebee specifically, and I found no source with the exact phrase \"Save PayPal and Venmo payment methods.\" The results are about PayPal vaulting in general, and two of them describe failure patterns that could be relevant to your error.\n\n- **Vaulting is what makes recurring billing work.** PayPal's Braintree docs say vaulting lets a merchant charge a PayPal account later without the customer present, and list subscriptions as a typical use. (Vaulted payments with PayPal account will allow you to charge the account in the future without requiring your customer to be present during the transaction)\n- **Reference transactions must be enabled on the PayPal account.** Piano's integration notes that recurring PayPal payments depend on this, and that it's switched on automatically for successfully onboarded clients. (In order to run recurring transactions, reference transactions will be enabled by PayPal automatically on all successfully onboarded clients through Piano.) This is worth checking on your PayPal account if vaulting is refused.\n- **Vaulting can fail even when the payment succeeds.** A WooCommerce support thread reports that vaulting runs as a separate step from the payment, so the payment can succeed while saving the method fails. (Vaulting works asynchronously with the actual payment and saving the payment method being two separate steps. The former can be successful with the latter failing.)\n- **An \"order not approved\" error on a vaulted button** appeared in another WooCommerce thread, where the error showed up only when vaulting was enabled. The thread was closed without a clear fix. (This vaulted button UI is only observed when the Vaulting option is enabled)\n\nFor Chargebee specifically, you'd need to check its PayPal gateway documentation or contact its support, and PayPal's own support for the account's vaulting and reference transaction status."],"durationSeconds":6.367210708999999,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a6a07470-f903-4eca-89ed-74903aa4335a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
{"parentUuid":"819c546f-2d99-41a3-bea6-bd4a5d5258a5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"799b69a1-f264-4fd3-ba48-35d327053b64","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PgJZsbFqDqqCs3Zi93DTd1","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Chargebee PayPal Complete Payments vault approval required subscriptions reference transactions\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"PayPal Payments Pro - Chargebee Docs\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal_payments_pro\"},{\"title\":\"PayPal Express Checkout - Chargebee Payment Docs\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal_express_checkout\"},{\"title\":\"Why do I need Reference Transactions?\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/kb/billing/why-do-i-need-reference-transactions\"},{\"title\":\"Why do I need Reference Transactions?\",\"url\":\"https://support.chargebee.com/support/solutions/articles/238214-why-do-i-need-reference-transactions-\"},{\"title\":\"PayPal Payflow Pro - Chargebee Docs\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal_payflow_pro\"},{\"title\":\"Payment Parameters\",\"url\":\"https://apidocs.chargebee.com/docs/api/payment_parameters?prod_cat_ver=1\"},{\"title\":\"Recurring Profile Tokens\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/kb/billing/i-have-a-paypal-recurring-profile-tokens-for-my-customers-can-i-use-this-with-chargebee\"},{\"title\":\"What is the billing agreement for PayPal Express Checkout?\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/kb/billing/what-is-the-billing-agreement-for-paypal-express-checkout\"},{\"title\":\"Payment sources\",\"url\":\"https://apidocs.chargebee.com/docs/api/payment_sources?lang=curl\"},{\"title\":\"Can PayPal be added as a payment method?\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/kb/billing/can-paypal-be-added-as-a-payment-method\"}]\n\nChargebee's docs don't mention \"Complete Payments\" specifically. The closest match is PayPal Payments Pro, which Chargebee lists as deprecated. Their docs point to PayPal Commerce for newer PayPal setups.\n\n- **Reference transactions are the approval gate for subscriptions.** Chargebee's docs say reference transactions must be enabled on the PayPal business account before recurring billing works. Your PayPal Business account needs to have Reference Transactions enabled before you can integrate it with Chargebee.\n- **Live accounts need a manual request.** Sandbox accounts don't have this on by default. For this to be enabled in your live account, you will have to reach out to PayPal Customer Support and raise a request. Chargebee says the approval usually takes some time. For security, PayPal support may require a phone call from an authorized account person (per Chargebee's KB article).\n- **Payments Pro is deprecated.** Chargebee's docs state that PayPal Payments Pro is now deprecated. Existing users can continue using the integration without interruption. However, new onboarding is no longer available.\n- **Payflow Pro has the same requirement.** Its page says reference transactions are mandatory for recurring subscriptions. It can be turned on under Account Administration > Manage Security > Transaction Settings.\n- **PayPal Commerce uses vault IDs or billing agreement IDs.** Chargebee's PayPal Commerce table lists a billing agreement ID for the Billing Agreements integration, and a PayPal Vault ID for the vault-based PayPal Wallet, Card, and Venmo flows. These go in the payment_method[reference_id] parameter.\n- **Workaround:** Chargebee says PayPal can also be connected via your Braintree gateway account, which doesn't require reference transactions.\n\nCaveat: some of these pages are old. One Chargebee support article is about 2640 days ago old. I didn't find current docs on Complete Payments or whether Chargebee supports it, so check with Chargebee and PayPal before relying on this.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"ef9ab545-8366-4d35-8407-5d0b308e72b3","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:23:00.089Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Chargebee PayPal Complete Payments vault approval required subscriptions reference transactions","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01F2i9pyGoMsWq5QKVnpXvYv","content":[{"title":"PayPal Payments Pro - Chargebee Docs","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal_payments_pro"},{"title":"PayPal Express Checkout - Chargebee Payment Docs","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal_express_checkout"},{"title":"Why do I need Reference Transactions?","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/kb/billing/why-do-i-need-reference-transactions"},{"title":"Why do I need Reference Transactions?","url":"https://support.chargebee.com/support/solutions/articles/238214-why-do-i-need-reference-transactions-"},{"title":"PayPal Payflow Pro - Chargebee Docs","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal_payflow_pro"},{"title":"Payment Parameters","url":"https://apidocs.chargebee.com/docs/api/payment_parameters?prod_cat_ver=1"},{"title":"Recurring Profile Tokens","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/kb/billing/i-have-a-paypal-recurring-profile-tokens-for-my-customers-can-i-use-this-with-chargebee"},{"title":"What is the billing agreement for PayPal Express Checkout?","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/kb/billing/what-is-the-billing-agreement-for-paypal-express-checkout"},{"title":"Payment sources","url":"https://apidocs.chargebee.com/docs/api/payment_sources?lang=curl"},{"title":"Can PayPal be added as a payment method?","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/kb/billing/can-paypal-be-added-as-a-payment-method"}]},"Chargebee's docs don't mention \"Complete Payments\" specifically. The closest match is PayPal Payments Pro, which Chargebee lists as deprecated. Their docs point to PayPal Commerce for newer PayPal setups.\n\n- **Reference transactions are the approval gate for subscriptions.** Chargebee's docs say reference transactions must be enabled on the PayPal business account before recurring billing works. Your PayPal Business account needs to have Reference Transactions enabled before you can integrate it with Chargebee.\n- **Live accounts need a manual request.** Sandbox accounts don't have this on by default. For this to be enabled in your live account, you will have to reach out to PayPal Customer Support and raise a request. Chargebee says the approval usually takes some time. For security, PayPal support may require a phone call from an authorized account person (per Chargebee's KB article).\n- **Payments Pro is deprecated.** Chargebee's docs state that PayPal Payments Pro is now deprecated. Existing users can continue using the integration without interruption. However, new onboarding is no longer available.\n- **Payflow Pro has the same requirement.** Its page says reference transactions are mandatory for recurring subscriptions. It can be turned on under Account Administration > Manage Security > Transaction Settings.\n- **PayPal Commerce uses vault IDs or billing agreement IDs.** Chargebee's PayPal Commerce table lists a billing agreement ID for the Billing Agreements integration, and a PayPal Vault ID for the vault-based PayPal Wallet, Card, and Venmo flows. These go in the payment_method[reference_id] parameter.\n- **Workaround:** Chargebee says PayPal can also be connected via your Braintree gateway account, which doesn't require reference transactions.\n\nCaveat: some of these pages are old. One Chargebee support article is about 2640 days ago old. I didn't find current docs on Complete Payments or whether Chargebee supports it, so check with Chargebee and PayPal before relying on this."],"durationSeconds":6.207967375,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"819c546f-2d99-41a3-bea6-bd4a5d5258a5","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
