:"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
{"parentUuid":"e1984227-35bb-4804-b488-4e75afcb9cba","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"799b69a1-f264-4fd3-ba48-35d327053b64","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Go6eA7RwWWVM74r1QhyaQo","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Chargebee docs \"PayPal Commerce\" gateway setup vault recurring payments enable\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"What's New in Chargebee\",\"url\":\"https://release-notes.chargebee.com/\"},{\"title\":\"PayPal Payflow Pro - Chargebee Docs\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal_payflow_pro\"},{\"title\":\"Payment Parameters\",\"url\":\"https://apidocs.chargebee.com/docs/api/payment_parameters?prod_cat_ver=1\"},{\"title\":\"Can PayPal be added as a payment method?\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/kb/billing/can-paypal-be-added-as-a-payment-method\"},{\"title\":\"Accept digital wallet payments with Chargebee\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/recurring-payments/digital-wallet-payments/\"},{\"title\":\"Wallets - Chargebee Payment Docs\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-methods/wallets-index\"},{\"title\":\"Manage Recurring Payments for Subscription businesses\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/manage-recurring-payments/\"},{\"title\":\"PayPal Payments Pro - Chargebee Docs\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal_payments_pro\"},{\"title\":\"PayPal Express Checkout - Chargebee Payment Docs\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/2.0/paypal_express_checkout.html\"},{\"title\":\"Recurring Profile Tokens\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/kb/billing/i-have-a-paypal-recurring-profile-tokens-for-my-customers-can-i-use-this-with-chargebee\"}]\n\nI didn't find the dedicated Chargebee PayPal Commerce setup page, so these results are indirect. Recurring-payment setup is covered in pieces across several Chargebee pages.\n\n- **Enabling Cards and Venmo:** Chargebee's release notes say you can turn these on yourself under Settings > Configure Chargebee > Payment Gateways, and that they use the same PayPal connection as PayPal wallet. The page is about 4,100 days old, so the steps may have changed. Chargebee no longer has to enable these methods for you.\n- **Vault IDs:** Chargebee's Payment Parameters API doc lists the PayPal Commerce input formats. For Card, Venmo, and the vault-based PayPal Wallet, the reference ID is a PayPal Vault ID. The Billing Agreements wallet integration uses a billing agreement ID instead. The doc also says to use gateway_account_id to select the PayPal account. Use gateway_account_id to select the corresponding PayPal account.\n- **PayPal wallet support:** Chargebee's wallet docs list PayPal via PayPal Commerce as the supported PayPal wallet option.\n- **Reference transactions:** The PayPal Payflow Pro doc says reference transactions are required for recurring charges on that gateway. It also says Payflow Pro accepts cards only and points to PayPal Commerce for PayPal accounts. Although PayPal Payflow Pro supports accepting payments via PayPal, Chargebee only accepts payments via cards. To accept payments via your customers' PayPal accounts, configure PayPal Commerce. The Express Checkout doc says reference transactions must be enabled on the live PayPal account and aren't on by default in sandbox.\n- **Deprecated gateway:** The PayPal Payments Pro doc says that gateway is deprecated and no longer open to new onboarding, and it also points to PayPal Commerce.\n\nI didn't find the actual PayPal Commerce gateway configuration steps (credentials, webhook setup, or the vault-enablement prerequisites on the PayPal side). Checking the current Chargebee docs directly would be the next step.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"3dee77ef-b8da-4fee-b672-26e73668c1d8","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:23:10.241Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Chargebee docs \"PayPal Commerce\" gateway setup vault recurring payments enable","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01W7uaX2etRKjT8tzyLv3bdk","content":[{"title":"What's New in Chargebee","url":"https://release-notes.chargebee.com/"},{"title":"PayPal Payflow Pro - Chargebee Docs","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal_payflow_pro"},{"title":"Payment Parameters","url":"https://apidocs.chargebee.com/docs/api/payment_parameters?prod_cat_ver=1"},{"title":"Can PayPal be added as a payment method?","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/kb/billing/can-paypal-be-added-as-a-payment-method"},{"title":"Accept digital wallet payments with Chargebee","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/recurring-payments/digital-wallet-payments/"},{"title":"Wallets - Chargebee Payment Docs","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-methods/wallets-index"},{"title":"Manage Recurring Payments for Subscription businesses","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/manage-recurring-payments/"},{"title":"PayPal Payments Pro - Chargebee Docs","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal_payments_pro"},{"title":"PayPal Express Checkout - Chargebee Payment Docs","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/2.0/paypal_express_checkout.html"},{"title":"Recurring Profile Tokens","url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/kb/billing/i-have-a-paypal-recurring-profile-tokens-for-my-customers-can-i-use-this-with-chargebee"}]},"I didn't find the dedicated Chargebee PayPal Commerce setup page, so these results are indirect. Recurring-payment setup is covered in pieces across several Chargebee pages.\n\n- **Enabling Cards and Venmo:** Chargebee's release notes say you can turn these on yourself under Settings > Configure Chargebee > Payment Gateways, and that they use the same PayPal connection as PayPal wallet. The page is about 4,100 days old, so the steps may have changed. Chargebee no longer has to enable these methods for you.\n- **Vault IDs:** Chargebee's Payment Parameters API doc lists the PayPal Commerce input formats. For Card, Venmo, and the vault-based PayPal Wallet, the reference ID is a PayPal Vault ID. The Billing Agreements wallet integration uses a billing agreement ID instead. The doc also says to use gateway_account_id to select the PayPal account. Use gateway_account_id to select the corresponding PayPal account.\n- **PayPal wallet support:** Chargebee's wallet docs list PayPal via PayPal Commerce as the supported PayPal wallet option.\n- **Reference transactions:** The PayPal Payflow Pro doc says reference transactions are required for recurring charges on that gateway. It also says Payflow Pro accepts cards only and points to PayPal Commerce for PayPal accounts. Although PayPal Payflow Pro supports accepting payments via PayPal, Chargebee only accepts payments via cards. To accept payments via your customers' PayPal accounts, configure PayPal Commerce. The Express Checkout doc says reference transactions must be enabled on the live PayPal account and aren't on by default in sandbox.\n- **Deprecated gateway:** The PayPal Payments Pro doc says that gateway is deprecated and no longer open to new onboarding, and it also points to PayPal Commerce.\n\nI didn't find the actual PayPal Commerce gateway configuration steps (credentials, webhook setup, or the vault-enablement prerequisites on the PayPal side). Checking the current Chargebee docs directly would be the next step."],"durationSeconds":6.881174749999999,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e1984227-35bb-4804-b488-4e75afcb9cba","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
{"parentUuid":"3dee77ef-b8da-4fee-b672-26e73668c1d8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Plain"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"4678c947-84b9-407f-ab5f-2e3681dea40b","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:23:10.329Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nPlain output style is active. Remember to follow the specific guidelines for this style.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","hash":"989617fd4f69291990cb694ed76c8c4fb79fc680d207a01ced8fa47116514752","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MQKiFgmSuKCjRXftu31onp","name":"ToolSearch","input":{"query":"select:WebFetch","max_results":1},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Go6eA7RwWWVM74r1QhyaQo","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"Chargebee docs \"PayPal Commerce\" gateway setup vault recurring payments enable","mode":"standard","allowed_domains":["chargebee.com"]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","hash":"488f74324a4e8547ed72240dfccfac4ed263d43381fcef57bf837e62bce402ce","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_01MQKiFgmSuKCjRXftu31onp","content":[{"type":"tool_reference","tool_name":"WebFetch"}]},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Go6eA7RwWWVM74r1QhyaQo","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Chargebee docs \"PayPal Commerce\" gateway setup vault recurring payments enable\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"What's New in Chargebee\",\"url\":\"https://release-notes.chargebee.com/\"},{\"title\":\"PayPal Payflow Pro - Chargebee Docs\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal_payflow_pro\"},{\"title\":\"Payment Parameters\",\"url\":\"https://apidocs.chargebee.com/docs/api/payment_parameters?prod_cat_ver=1\"},{\"title\":\"Can PayPal be added as a payment method?\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/kb/billing/can-paypal-be-added-as-a-payment-method\"},{\"title\":\"Accept digital wallet payments with Chargebee\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/recurring-payments/digital-wallet-payments/\"},{\"title\":\"Wallets - Chargebee Payment Docs\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-methods/wallets-index\"},{\"title\":\"Manage Recurring Payments for Subscription businesses\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/manage-recurring-payments/\"},{\"title\":\"PayPal Payments Pro - Chargebee Docs\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal_payments_pro\"},{\"title\":\"PayPal Express Checkout - Chargebee Payment Docs\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/2.0/paypal_express_checkout.html\"},{\"title\":\"Recurring Profile Tokens\",\"url\":\"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/kb/billing/i-have-a-paypal-recurring-profile-tokens-for-my-customers-can-i-use-this-with-chargebee\"}]\n\nI didn't find the dedicated Chargebee PayPal Commerce setup page, so these results are indirect. Recurring-payment setup is covered in pieces across several Chargebee pages.\n\n- **Enabling Cards and Venmo:** Chargebee's release notes say you can turn these on yourself under Settings > Configure Chargebee > Payment Gateways, and that they use the same PayPal connection as PayPal wallet. The page is about 4,100 days old, so the steps may have changed. Chargebee no longer has to enable these methods for you.\n- **Vault IDs:** Chargebee's Payment Parameters API doc lists the PayPal Commerce input formats. For Card, Venmo, and the vault-based PayPal Wallet, the reference ID is a PayPal Vault ID. The Billing Agreements wallet integration uses a billing agreement ID instead. The doc also says to use gateway_account_id to select the PayPal account. Use gateway_account_id to select the corresponding PayPal account.\n- **PayPal wallet support:** Chargebee's wallet docs list PayPal via PayPal Commerce as the supported PayPal wallet option.\n- **Reference transactions:** The PayPal Payflow Pro doc says reference transactions are required for recurring charges on that gateway. It also says Payflow Pro accepts cards only and points to PayPal Commerce for PayPal accounts. Although PayPal Payflow Pro supports accepting payments via PayPal, Chargebee only accepts payments via cards. To accept payments via your customers' PayPal accounts, configure PayPal Commerce. The Express Checkout doc says reference transactions must be enabled on the live PayPal account and aren't on by default in sandbox.\n- **Deprecated gateway:** The PayPal Payments Pro doc says that gateway is deprecated and no longer open to new onboarding, and it also points to PayPal Commerce.\n\nI didn't find the actual PayPal Commerce gateway configuration steps (credentials, webhook setup, or the vault-enablement prerequisites on the PayPal side). Checking the current Chargebee docs directly would be the next step.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."},{"type":"text","text":"Tool loaded."}]}}
