{"parentUuid":"4678c947-84b9-407f-ab5f-2e3681dea40b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwvUMKqk6X5Yb4itjDus","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011SCqiAbYRK94BcQfD12Bfn","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal-commerce","prompt":"What does Chargebee say about recurring/subscription payments with PayPal Commerce: vaulting, reference transactions, billing agreements, any PayPal account approval needed, and what happens if vaulting isn't approved? Quote the relevant sentences."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2271,"cache_read_input_tokens":362766,"output_tokens":193,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2271,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":193,"cache_read_input_tokens":362766,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2271,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2271},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":1268,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_011SCqiAbYRK94BcQfD12Bfn":{"url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal-commerce","prompt":"What does Chargebee say about recurring/subscription payments with PayPal Commerce: vaulting, reference transactions, billing agreements, any PayPal account approval needed, and what happens if vaulting isn't approved? Quote the relevant sentences."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"e64d998b-5f88-453a-9100-b2cb1ce77842","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwvUM1jtHHgtYV7phvKJ","requestRef":"601016e6-493c-4ae9-909b-98618f179c4f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"24e3257a-2091-4c28-9f65-7de6c662e1c1","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:23:12.734Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
{"parentUuid":"24e3257a-2091-4c28-9f65-7de6c662e1c1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"799b69a1-f264-4fd3-ba48-35d327053b64","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011SCqiAbYRK94BcQfD12Bfn","type":"tool_result","content":"**Vaulting:** The Vault ID is created on a customer's first PayPal purchase and lets Chargebee charge renewals without customer action. As the page states, \"The Vault ID allows Chargebee to charge your customers automatically without them having to perform any action\" during renewals. \"The Vault ID does not expire unless the customer cancels it.\"\n\n**Reference transactions:** Chargebee requires them for live sites. \"Enable reference transactions on your PayPal Business Account.\" \"This is required for Chargebee live sites.\" \"Reference Transactions are not supported in PayPal sandbox accounts.\"\n\n**Billing agreements:** Chargebee doesn't use the legacy Billing Agreement ID for Cards or Venmo. \"Billing Agreement ID (BAID) is the legacy token format and is deprecated by PayPal.\" For Cards and Venmo, \"use Vault ID only.\"\n\n**Account approval:** You need a PayPal Business Account, and Advanced Card Processing must be enabled. \"A Personal Account cannot be used.\" Reference transactions must be enabled through PayPal Customer Support. Enabling Cards or Venmo also requires the right scopes: \"Enabling a payment method fails if the connected PayPal account does not have the required scopes.\"\n\n**If vaulting isn't approved:** The content doesn't say. It doesn't describe a vaulting approval step or what happens if vaulting is unavailable. For scope failures, it advises reconnecting your PayPal account from the gateway configuration page."}]},"uuid":"f8486807-0e24-4363-9d2c-a6194fa49d23","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:23:20.955Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":237742,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Vaulting:** The Vault ID is created on a customer's first PayPal purchase and lets Chargebee charge renewals without customer action. As the page states, \"The Vault ID allows Chargebee to charge your customers automatically without them having to perform any action\" during renewals. \"The Vault ID does not expire unless the customer cancels it.\"\n\n**Reference transactions:** Chargebee requires them for live sites. \"Enable reference transactions on your PayPal Business Account.\" \"This is required for Chargebee live sites.\" \"Reference Transactions are not supported in PayPal sandbox accounts.\"\n\n**Billing agreements:** Chargebee doesn't use the legacy Billing Agreement ID for Cards or Venmo. \"Billing Agreement ID (BAID) is the legacy token format and is deprecated by PayPal.\" For Cards and Venmo, \"use Vault ID only.\"\n\n**Account approval:** You need a PayPal Business Account, and Advanced Card Processing must be enabled. \"A Personal Account cannot be used.\" Reference transactions must be enabled through PayPal Customer Support. Enabling Cards or Venmo also requires the right scopes: \"Enabling a payment method fails if the connected PayPal account does not have the required scopes.\"\n\n**If vaulting isn't approved:** The content doesn't say. It doesn't describe a vaulting approval step or what happens if vaulting is unavailable. For scope failures, it advises reconnecting your PayPal account from the gateway configuration page.","durationMs":8111,"url":"https://www.chargebee.com/docs/payments/2.0/payment-gateways-and-configuration/paypal-commerce"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"24e3257a-2091-4c28-9f65-7de6c662e1c1","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
