current; [Model pickers](composer-model-pickers.md) — per chat; [Keeps its model](chat-keeps-its-model.md) — no mid-chat switch; [Turn activity](agent-turn-activity-proposal.md) — one line per turn; [Chat capture](jusprin-chat-capture-design.md) — on in prod 2026-11-10, policy clause not opt-in; [Rebuild a request](rebuild-wire-request-from-saved-chat.md) — current-state.json; [DeepSeek images](live-app-deepseek-drops-images.md) — 404; [Standard titles](standard-title-answers-instead.md) — 4 of 12 refused.\n- Skills: [File-loaded](skill-model-arrived.md); [Slice-failed](skill-slice-failed.md); [Setup-changed](skill-setup-changed.md); [Print-issues](skill-print-issues.md); [Integrated](skills-integrated-branch.md) — 8913319cac.\n- App guide: [For AI and people](app-guide-for-ai-and-people.md) — docs/guide page builds a skill; GitHub first; Sonnet 24/24 vs 3/24; [Say what text](say-what-text-the-model-receives.md) — never \"the AI sees\".\n- Evals: [Live suite](live-suite-is-part-of-done.md) — part of done; [Eval spend](prompt-eval-spend-budget.md) — ask first; [Measurements](project-prompt-eval-sample-size.md) — stub rates retracted; [Live eval](live-eval-after-only-vs-baseline.md) — after-only vs baseline; [Harness critique](project-prompt-harness-critique.md); [Harness ported](project-prompt-harness-ported.md) — --project-prompt-requests; [Recorder noise](request-recorder-run-to-run-noise.md) — what to normalise; [Reply cut at 160](prompt-runner-truncates-replies.md) — lift before reading replies; slicer-basic = DeepSeek V4 Flash; [Print-setup cases](print-setup-prompt-cases.md).\n- Design process: [Design source](design-source-is-claude-artifacts.md) — Claude artifacts; [Design artifacts](jusprin-claude-design-system-artifact.md) — URLs, re-sync; [Token sync](design-token-sync-decisions.md) — chip 28, rows 36; [Design before code](update-design-before-code.md) — boards first; [Mark old boards](new-board-marks-old-superseded.md) — every page; [Show in screen](show-