{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:27:50.423Z","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","content":"<cross-session-message from=\"local_d10fadbb-75f7-474b-a76e-f935471da8b6\" from-name=\"Working folder rules clarity\">\nKenneth asked me to check on a branch this session created. Please answer, but don't merge or delete anything yet.\n\nThe branch claude/plan-ends-line in ~/Projects/JusPrin has one commit that was never pushed and isn't in jusprin-dev: 6f1f03867d \"Preferences: a cancelled plan says when it ends, not when it renews\" (2026-11-10). It touches PreferencesApp.test.tsx, bridge/protocol.ts and components/Preferences.tsx. Kenneth wants each branch either merged into jusprin-dev or clearly abandoned. Which is it for this one, and what, if anything, is blocking it?\n\nSomething you should know: the worktree folder ~/Projects/JusPrin-worktrees/plan-ends-line was moved to the Trash today. It had no uncommitted changes. The branch and its commit are untouched. If you need a checkout, create it under ~/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/, not in JusPrin-worktrees.\n\nPlease reply by sending a message to session local_d10fadbb-75f7-474b-a76e-f935471da8b6 (\"Working folder rules clarity\").\n</cross-session-message>"}
