{"parentUuid":"e4d7201b-f63f-47bb-a84a-291da2d76e0b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"f7eb275a-159c-48fe-9b20-ec17dee1e5f9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DpgnqdpGYh3Lw22qU2ZMRG","type":"tool_result","content":"6f1f03867d Kenneth Jiang Tue Nov 10 10:16:39 2026 -0800\nPreferences: a cancelled plan says when it ends, not when it renews\n\nAfter a cancel, Account still read \"Renews 10 Dec.\" because the server sent\nonly the term's end as renews_at. The server now sends renews_at null and\nends_at for a cancelled plan, and Account shows \"Ends 10 Dec.\" from it.\nA server without ends_at shows what it did before.\n\nEntire-Checkpoint: 01M73ATAZEV5K3JVB1G6SPQ0EH\n\n\n .../GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/PreferencesApp.test.tsx      | 16 ++++++++++++++++\n src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/bridge/protocol.ts    |  3 +++\n .../GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/src/components/Preferences.tsx   |  4 +++-\n 3 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)\n---\n  claude/plan-ends-line\n6f1f03867d Preferences: a cancelled plan says when it ends, not when it renews\nnot-in-dev\n---\nplan-ends-line /Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin-worktrees/plan-ends-line jusprin-dev && ls -d src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/node_modules && ln -s /Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/node_\nplan-ends-line/src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/node_modules && git -C /Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin-worktrees/plan-ends-line log --oneline -1\nplan-ends-line /Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin-worktrees/plan-ends-line jusprin-dev && ls -d src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/node_modules && ln -s /Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/node_\nplan-ends-line/src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/node_modules && git -C /Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin-worktrees/plan-ends-line log --oneline -1\nplan-ends-line /Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin-worktrees/plan-ends-line jusprin-dev && ls -d src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin/AgentUI/node_modules && ln -s /Users/kenneth/Projects