{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","id":"a50bb4bc-0e04-4717-ab45-8d9310f6c517","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:28:09.078Z","version":"2.1.321","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"1b4d38a5eb11a691f0e44b7d1ff3ba2b6049d0016dff835cbfcdef92b1844758","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}},"base":"7b59f49d-bcf0-47f0-a9d0-c56c3ecc8c2e","keep":80,"tail":["283a1bb0655cea463b56810ca33555df08c003cf539b3b1591f5db1381573af8","2c58cb29aa0b93c057a5ecafe3af610615d6422a6cef54120d80b809f410b865","8d5417819870814c986d7076932ad2dcad28287bdd05a674772b4c6ce5fb42e5"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",82,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"d3cb206e323ec2b9850151e337931c68d436ed18ecee7134ef10e5c87e4c6313"}
{"parentUuid":"4571ec94-4cf0-46d5-b2fd-cf0eddd4aa5f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwvrMpiX5fhzL7sYEMEt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019A8vpRMLYDaUAZ6X2o9zQh","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"local_d10fadbb-75f7-474b-a76e-f935471da8b6","summary":"Answer about claude/plan-ends-line branch","message":"claude/plan-ends-line should be merged into jusprin-dev, not abandoned. Nothing blocks it; it was just never landed.\n\nWhat it is: after someone cancels a JusPrin 2 plan, Preferences > Account kept saying \"Renews 10 Dec.\" Commit 6f1f03867d makes it say \"Ends 10 Dec.\" It reads a new `ends_at` field from the server's /v2/account reply. When the server sends no `ends_at`, the app shows the old line.\n\nWhy it's safe to land now:\n- The server half is already in production. It went to tsd-enterprise master and shipped from obi.4104 on. On staging on 2026-11-10, I checked that a cancelled plan's account reply carries no renewal date and an end date of 10 Dec.\n- jusprin-dev has no `ends_at` code yet, so nothing else has replaced this commit.\n- `git merge-tree` shows it merges into today's jusprin-dev with no conflicts. Two later commits on jusprin-dev touch Preferences.tsx or protocol.ts, so the AgentUI tests (PreferencesApp.test.tsx) should be re-run after merging. I haven't re-run them on top of today's jusprin-dev.\n\nWhy it sat: I committed it on its own branch while the server side was unreleased, then the work moved on to staging and production and I never came back to land it. That's my miss, not a hold.\n\nI'm not merging or deleting anything, as you asked.","type":"message","recipient":"local_d10fadbb-75f7-474b-a76e-f935471da8b6","recipient_kind":"session","content":"claude/plan-ends-line should be merged into juspr…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2185,"cache_read_input_tokens":141532,"output_tokens":612,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2185,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":612,"cache_read_input_tokens":141532,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2185,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2185},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":5110,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_019A8vpRMLYDaUAZ6X2o9zQh":{"to":"local_d10fadbb-75f7-474b-a76e-f935471da8b6","summary":"Answer about claude/plan-ends-line branch","message":"claude/plan-ends-line should be merged into jusprin-dev, not abandoned. Nothing blocks it; it was just never landed.\n\nWhat it is: after someone cancels a JusPrin 2 plan, Preferences > Account kept saying \"Renews 10 Dec.\" Commit 6f1f03867d makes it say \"Ends 10 Dec.\" It reads a new `ends_at` field from the server's /v2/account reply. When the server sends no `ends_at`, the app shows the old line.\n\nWhy it's safe to land now:\n- The server half is already in production. It went to tsd-enterprise master and shipped from obi.4104 on. On staging on 2026-11-10, I checked that a cancelled plan's account reply carries no renewal date and an end date of 10 Dec.\n- jusprin-dev has no `ends_at` code yet, so nothing else has replaced this commit.\n- `git merge-tree` shows it merges into today's jusprin-dev with no conflicts. Two later commits on jusprin-dev touch Preferences.tsx or protocol.ts, so the AgentUI tests (PreferencesApp.test.tsx) should be re-run after merging. I haven't re-run them on top of today's jusprin-dev.\n\nWhy it sat: I committed it on its own branch while the server side was unreleased, then the work moved on to staging and production and I never came back to land it. That's my miss, not a hold.\n\nI'm not merging or deleting anything, as you asked."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"2cd81ee1-ce32-4755-8134-1f9e8fbfa09d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwvrMZ79ayfreZ3MAHSd","requestRef":"a50bb4bc-0e04-4717-ab45-8d9310f6c517","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"d2d04c25-64ce-47ad-826a-a22502e39519","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:28:14.929Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
