{"parentUuid":"35931998-183d-42e0-8796-57c781820bd6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwvronRMnbTATNFHxs31","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I sent my answer to the session checking working folders: the `claude/plan-ends-line` branch should be merged into jusprin-dev, and nothing is blocking it. The message is queued there because that session is in the middle of a turn, so it hasn't been read yet.\n\nThe branch has one commit, 6f1f03867d. After someone cancels a JusPrin 2 plan, Preferences > Account kept saying \"Renews 10 Dec.\"; this commit makes it say \"Ends 10 Dec.\" instead. The server change it depends on is already in production. It merges into today's jusprin-dev with no conflicts, and jusprin-dev has nothing that replaces it. Its AgentUI tests should be re-run after the merge, because two later commits touch the same files; I haven't re-run them yet. It never landed because I committed it while the server change wasn't released yet, then never came back to it. As that session asked, I didn't merge or delete anything.\n\nThe PayPal question is unchanged: once you sign in to PayPal in the Chrome tab I left open, I can check TSD's account."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":889,"cache_read_input_tokens":143717,"output_tokens":346,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":889,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":346,"cache_read_input_tokens":143717,"cache_creation_input_tokens":889,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":889},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"contex