{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","id":"a0bbf5ae-e2e4-4ed5-b725-9870558817fd","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:43:16.277Z","version":"2.1.321","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"1b4d38a5eb11a691f0e44b7d1ff3ba2b6049d0016dff835cbfcdef92b1844758","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}},"base":"726fc468-d8b0-48a8-b398-4ef4ecefa479","keep":110,"tail":["a9d4a359dfabc140570e5b5d29d20d10cbb583746a30df08fa1c98641dc982e5","0d123d057eb9096a527fca64c1c7ce097aba846871c21999249e7f399457a693","8d5417819870814c986d7076932ad2dcad28287bdd05a674772b4c6ce5fb42e5"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",112,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"5753d7d7357f7fe4b5f6b2bb3dfe5a0c56a50d0e367296d859fa7d10c67a1fdc"}
{"parentUuid":"c0e25347-3c71-46e2-9451-d14f531afa3d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwx1EpAP2FT2bLQWNLx9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I found one of Obico's PayPal renewals in TSD's PayPal account. It's transaction 6HV94537A2906060M from today: $10.49, \"Payment Received\", Reason \"Billing Agreement\". So Obico and JusPrin 2 use the same PayPal account, and that account can charge a customer again later through the older Express Checkout connection that Obico's Chargebee site uses.\n\nJusPrin 2's live site connects through PayPal Commerce instead. That's PayPal's newer connection, and it saves a customer's PayPal account a different way, called vaulting. That newer way is the one PayPal declined for TSD. So my hypothesis is that a JusPrin 2 plan paid with PayPal either fails at checkout or works the first time and fails at renewal. A real purchase will tell us which of the first two happens.\n\n**How to run the test.**\n1. Use the copy of JusPrin I just reopened. It's signed in to production with your account, k@obico.io. Open Credits and plans.\n2. Click \"Open in browser\" so checkout opens in Chrome. This copy was built before the fix for the PayPal window inside the app, so the in-app sheet may still get stuck on PayPal.\n3. Pick Hobby monthly. It's $10, or $8 if your Obico Premium discount applies.\n4. Choose PayPal and approve the payment yourself. I can't move money.\n\nBefore you start, the live site has your customer record, `jusprinv2-263741`, and no subscriptions or payments. Once you've paid, or if it fails, tell me what you saw on screen. Then I'll check:\n- what Chargebee recorded for the subscription,\n- what PayPal saved for renewals: a billing agreement, a saved (vaulted) PayPal account, or nothing,\n- whether the webhook added your 1,500 credits.\n\nAfterwards, you cancel the plan and issue the refund, since both move money. I'll check that the cancel shows up correctly in the app.\n\nSeparately, the PayPal checkout session stopped the Windows test VM `jusprin-win-test`; the Linux test VM is stopped too. A session that started the Windows VM at 13:08 will have to start it again if it still needs it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":645,"cache_read_input_tokens":152145,"output_tokens":721,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":645,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":721,"cache_read_input_tokens":152145,"cache_creation_input_tokens":645,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":645},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0063d2e3-88d7-4d73-a80c-a02f203d4c1b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgwx1EJejNnEv99A37bRx","requestRef":"a0bbf5ae-e2e4-4ed5-b725-9870558817fd","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"d39f2e82-af39-45c4-bf91-989e96554bac","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:43:23.541Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
