{"parentUuid":"6188fa8a-cb90-4e33-9946-87468f468034","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"04643f2c-984c-4aca-9e8e-a0f722f48778","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nLinked sessions now (status, not an instruction): paypal-checkout-fails-in = local_92607d89-53ce-49de-b66c-6c7f1e5b7f3f (idle); put-the-jusprin-2-server = local_2e8b84da-58b4-4ef1-bd87-b76f805fdf4d (idle); opt-in-before-jusprin-2 = local_5b5c4dae-b676-44e9-9c1a-7469fec69e96 (idle, started by put-the-jusprin-2-server); home-shows-stale-credits = local_afbc5de2-baa6-429c-8931-f6dc91d5bc32 (idle, started by put-the-jusprin-2-server); plan-jusprin-1-user-hand = local_87a60f59-f953-4ea7-b0fb-1f96b66823b6 (idle); add-skip-for-now-to-the = local_d4832d18-4b62-4c0c-925e-e47fe437c2e2 (idle); home-let-people-dismiss = local_2c6fda28-de55-4fec-a9fa-f183faf7c9b5 (idle); get-the-jusprin-dev-nigh = local_85d6fc0f-9739-485a-a6c5-cb976c6afbea (idle); jusprin-2-announcement-o = local_3f72dc00-322a-4889-8844-542d5ba987d6 (idle). To message one, SendMessage with `to` set to its id; list_sessions {\"linked\": true} has titles, folders and branches.\n</system-reminder>\n\n"},{"type":"text","text":"`claude/plan-ends-line`: should be merged\n\n* What it fixes: after someone cancels a JusPrin 2 plan, Preferences › Account still says “Renews 10 Dec.” This commit makes it say “Ends 10 Dec.” It reads an `ends_at` field that the server already sends in production.\n* Why it stalled: it was committed while the server side wasn’t released yet, and the session never came back to it. Nothing is blocking it.\n* What I checked: it merges into today’s jusprin-dev with no conflicts, and jusprin-dev has no `ends_at` code yet.\n* What’s not checked yet: two later jusprin-dev commits touched the same Preferences files, so its tests need to be re-run after the merge. Nobody has done that yet.\n\nis it correct? Do you have other open items?"}]},"uuid":"2dde6f0b-5f3e-405c-b632-7d1f4dd4ccf1","timestamp":"2026-11-11T23:10:19.927Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":47,"turnIndex":74},"clientPlatform":"desktop_app","turnAttributionKey":"2dde6f0b-5f3e-405c-b632-7d1f4dd4ccf1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","version":"2.1.321","gitBranch":"jusprin-dev","slug":"rosy-bubbling-whisper"}
