{"parentUuid":"68939e4c-23a7-482b-8fb6-c1e93dfd76b4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwzTQx5C58xZV9pwVmmt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I merged `claude/plan-ends-line` into jusprin-dev as merge commit 8838af0820. Now, after someone cancels a JusPrin 2 plan, Preferences › Account says \"Ends 10 Dec.\" instead of \"Renews 10 Dec.\"\n\nThe merge had no conflicts. On the merged code, the AgentUI type check passes, and all 718 AgentUI tests pass, including the new test that expects \"$10 a month. Ends 10 Dec.\" I haven't looked at it in the running app: that needs a cancelled plan on an account.\n\nThe branch is deleted. It had never been pushed to GitHub, and its commit is now part of jusprin-dev. The temporary worktree I used for the merge is gone too.\n\nNothing is on GitHub yet. Local jusprin-dev in `~/Projects/JusPrin` is two commits ahead of GitHub: the fix itself and the merge commit."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":324,"cache_read_input_tokens":165738,"output_tokens":303,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":324,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":303,"cache_read_input_tokens":165738,"cache_creation_input_tokens":324,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":324},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"41d5a295-fdd2-4442-ac47-54c684392662","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwzTQiRdDZN4xZQroTek","requestRef":"3dc912ab-eb1a-40e8-956f-5ae427b41572","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h"