{"parentUuid":"7cb42c8b-7e4a-4ef0-915f-1c06028fc56d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgx1Daifi61UdrSZRLWo6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ARnXiRrE9Ex8vzM37vVx6y","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/memory/no-merge-commits-on-jusprin-dev.md","content":"---\nname: no-merge-commits-on-jusprin-dev\ndescription: \"2026-11-11 Kenneth: 'I hate a very noisy branch with a lot of merge commits.' Land a short branch on jusprin-dev by cherry-pick or rebase, not a merge commit.\"\nmetadata:\n  type: feedback\n---\n\nKenneth, 2026-11-11, when asked whether to merge claude/plan-ends-line (one commit) into jusprin-dev: \"Are you going to create a merge commit? I hate a very noisy branch with a lot of merge commits.\"\n\nThe same day the main session missed that side-thread answer and landed it with `git merge --no-ff` (8838af0820) and pushed it.\n\n**Why:** jusprin-dev's history is what Kenneth reads; merge commits for one-commit branches are noise.\n\n**How to apply:** land a branch on jusprin-dev as plain commits (cherry-pick, or rebase then fast-forward). Before landing, check side threads (btw forks of this session) for anything Kenneth said about how to land. Ask only if the branch is long enough that a merge commit might be wanted. Refines [[merge-no-ff-not-squash]] and [[commit-to-integration-branch]].\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":489,"cache_read_input_tokens":181649,"output_tokens":1171,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":251},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":489,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1171,"c