{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"14cb6590-7113-489e-aa7f-9aa6dca15e79","hash":"f41ce7a464c9a01d354c2cb775b24835524558b57a89955889f2e3b890627cc3","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ARnXiRrE9Ex8vzM37vVx6y","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/memory/no-merge-commits-on-jusprin-dev.md","content":"---\nname: no-merge-commits-on-jusprin-dev\ndescription: \"2026-11-11 Kenneth: 'I hate a very noisy branch with a lot of merge commits.' Land a short branch on jusprin-dev by cherry-pick or rebase, not a merge commit.\"\nmetadata:\n  type: feedback\n---\n\nKenneth, 2026-11-11, when asked whether to merge claude/plan-ends-line (one commit) into jusprin-dev: \"Are you going to create a merge commit? I hate a very noisy branch with a lot of merge commits.\"\n\nThe same day the main session missed that side-thread answer and landed it with `git merge --no-ff` (8838af0820) and pushed it.\n\n**Why:** jusprin-dev's history is what Kenneth reads; merge commits for one-commit branches are noise.\n\n**How to apply:** land a branch on jusprin-dev as plain commits (cherry-pick, or rebase then fast-forward). Before landing, check side threads (btw forks of this session) for anything Kenneth said about how to land. Ask only if the branch is long enough that a merge commit might be wanted. Refines [[merge-no-ff-not-squash]] and [[commit-to-integration-branch]].\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0191s4LD3aGV3XAW7DLLYWee","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd ~/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/memory && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='MEMORY.md'; s=open(p).read()\nold='[Landing rule removed](merge-no-ff-not-squash.md) — ask how to land;'\nnew='[Landing rule removed](merge-no-ff-not-squash.md) — ask how to land; [No merge commits](no-merge-commits-on-jusprin-dev.md) — cherry-pick short branches;'\nassert old in s; open(p,'w').write(s.replace(old,new))\nEOF","description":"Add the memory pointer to the index"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017f434M1pLg5fhk5HVNHyGA","name":"mcp__ccd_session_mgmt__list_events","input":{"session_id":"local_92607d89-53ce-49de-b66c-6c7f1e5b7f3f","limit":8},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
