{"parentUuid":"35e37570-3b2f-472f-9ed8-f08b737cce40","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgx1aXF9WNYrU4mnG1xJ1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I replaced the merge commit. jusprin-dev on GitHub now ends with the fix as one ordinary commit, 12e1529cb6 \"Preferences: a cancelled plan says when it ends, not when it renews\". It sits directly on top of 846e01d06c, the commit that was the tip before the merge.\n\n- **Same content as before.** The new commit's files are identical to what the merge commit produced. I re-ran the AgentUI type check and all 718 AgentUI tests on it, and they pass.\n- **The push was guarded.** I used `--force-with-lease`, so the push would have been refused if anyone had pushed to jusprin-dev in the meantime. Nobody had.\n- **Your main checkout is in step.** `~/Projects/JusPrin` is on the new commit and matches GitHub. Your untracked file `new-project-handling-report.md` is still there, untouched.\n- **The merge commit is gone.** No branch contains 8838af0820 anymore, and the temporary worktree I used is removed.\n\nYour remaining action items:\n1. Run the PayPal plan test.\n2. After it, decide what to do about PayPal for plans.\n3. Optionally, rotate the two secrets I printed earlier: Obico's live Chargebee API key and the reCAPTCHA secret."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1416,"cache_read_input_tokens":198366,"output_tokens":425,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1416,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":425,"cache_read_input_tokens":198366,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1416,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1